<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- NGONI Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Matei</para>
  <para style="toc1">Linenu la Bwina liyandikwi na Matei</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matei</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Linenu la Bwina liyandikwi na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matei</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Linenu la Bwina ngati cheliyandikwi na Matei ndi chitabu chimonga pagati ya vitabu mcheche mu Lilaganu la Hinu vyevijova ndava ya kutama kwa Bambu Yesu pamulima apa. Kila chitabu chikemelewa “Injili.” Mana yaki “Linenu la Bwina.” Vitabu vyenivi viyandikwi na Matei na Maluko na Luka na Yohani lukumbi Yesu peamali kufwa vasomi vamanyi lepi chakaka kuvya ndali Matei ayandiki chitabu chenichi, nambu yihotoleka mu lukumbi lwa mwaka wa 60, peamali kuvelekewa Yesu. Mewawa pandu pechayandikwi chitabu ichi pangamanyikana. Nambu vamahele vihololela kuvya chayandikiwi pamulima wa Palestina, na pangi chayandikwi pamuji wa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Myandika wa chitabu ichi ndi Matei mweavi mtola kodi kwakona angakemelewa na Yesu avyai muwuliwa waki liina lingi la mundu uyu akemiwayi Lawi. Matei avi mmonga wa vamitumi kumi na vavili na achiyandiki chitabu chenichi ndava ya vasomaji va Chiyawudi. Yeniyi yilangisa hotohoto na mayandiku neju ya 60 geagatolili kuhuma mu Lilaganu la Kadeni. Matei aganili kulangisa kuvya Yesu avi Msangula mweahaguliwi na Chapanga, mwenuyu ndi mlota va Chapanga mwealongolili kujova malovi gaki. Mewawa Matei ayandiki neju kuuvala Unkosi wa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Vayawudi valindalila kuvya Msangula ngaavi Nkosi wa vandu pamulima apa. Matei muluhala lwamahele akugabela maholo ago, kwa kudandaula Unkosi wa Chapanga ndi wa chimpungu. Linenu la Bwina liyandikwi na Matei ndi chitabu chabwina mu kutumbula Lilaganu la Hinu ndava ya Mayandiku Gamsopi gamahele gegahumili mu Lilaganu la Kadeni gegavi mwenumo. Chitabu chenichi chiwunganisa Malaganu goha gavili. Vasomi mewa vijova Matei avi mu kulinga kulanda uyandika wa vitabu mhanu vya kutumbula mu lilaganu la kadeni vya Musa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Makokoso ga Yesu kuchitumbi (Matei musula ya 5-7) Yihotola kuwanangisa na Chapanga pala peakumgotolela Musa malagizu gaki. Kumbukumbu la Tolati (musula ya 19:3-23:33)</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavi</para>
  <para style="io">Matei itumbula linenu la bwina mukudandaula kuvelekewa kwa Yesu Kilisitu na kutumbula kwa lihengu laki (musula ya 1-4).</para>
  <para style="io">Mawuliwu gamahele ga Yesu (musula ya 5-25).</para>
  <para style="io">Musula za mwishu, Matei idandaula kuuvala mwishu wa lihengu la Yesu kufwa na kuyuka kwaki (musula 26-28).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Chenichi ndi chitabu cha lukolo lwa Yesu Kilisitu mweavi chiveleku cha Daudi wa chiveleku cha Ibulahimu.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ibulahimu amveliki Izaki, Izaki amveliki Yakobo, Yakobo amveliki Yuda na valongo vaki, <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda amveliki Pelisi na Zela, nyina wavi avili Tamali, Felikisi amveliki Heziloni, Heziloni amveliki Lami, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Lami amveliki Aminadabu, Aminadabu amveliki Nashoni, Nashoni amveliki Solomoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Solomoni na Lahabu vamveliki Boazi, Boazi na Lutu vamveliki Obedi, Obedi amveliki Yese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />mwene Yese amveliki Nkosi Daudi. Daudi amveliki Solomoni, nyina waki avi mdala wa Uliya, <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomoni amveliki Lehobohamu, Lehobohamu amveliki Abiya, Abiya amveliki Asa, <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa amveliki Yeoshafati, Yeoshafati amveliki Yolamu, Yolamu amveliki Uzia, <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzia amveliki Yotamu, Yotamu amveliki Ahazi, Ahazi amveliki Hezekia, <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekia amveliki Menasi, Menasi amveliki Amoni, Amoni amveliki Yosia, <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosia amveliki Yekonia na valongo vaki. Lwenulo ndi lwavi lukumbi lwa Vayawudi pavapelikwi kuluhamilu ku Babeli.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Lukumbi Vayawudi pevavi kuluhamilu ku Babeli, Yekonia amveliki Shealitieli, Shealitieli amveliki Zelubabeli, <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zelubabeli amveliki Abiudi, Abiudi amveliki Eliakimu, Eliakimu amveliki Azoli, <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azoli amveliki Zadoki, Zadoki amveliki Akimu, Akimu amveliki Eliudi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliudi amveliki Eleazali, Eleazali amveliki Matani, Matani amveliki Yakobo. <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakobo amveliki Yosefu, mngwana wa Maliya, nyina waki Yesu mweikemiwa Kilisitu.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Kwavi na viveleku kumi na mcheche kuhuma Ibulahimu mbaka Daudi, vivelekelu kumi na mcheche kuhuma Daudi mbaka Vayawudi pavatoliwi uvanda wa ku Babeli, viveleku kumi na mcheche kuhuma uvanda mbaka kuvelekewa kwa Kilisitu.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvelekwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Chenichi ndi cheavelekiwi Yesu Kilisitu. Maliya nyina wa Yesu, achumbiwi na Yosefu. Nambu vakona vangatama ngati mngwana na mdala, Maliya apatili kuvya na ndumbu kwa makakala ga Mpungu Msopi. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Ndava Yosefu mngwana wa Maliya avi mundu mbwina palongolo ya Chapanga aganili lepi kumpela soni pavandu ndi aholalili kumleka chamfiyu. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Peavi akona ihololela lijambu lenilo, Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga amuhumali munjozi na kumjovela, “Yosefu, mwana wa Daudi, ukotoka kuyogopa kumtola Maliya avya mdala waku, muni ndumbu yeavinayu apatili kwa makakala ga Mpungu Msopi. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Yati iveleka mwana mgosi hinu veve yati ukumpela liina Yesu ndava mwenuyu yati akuvasangula vandu kuhuma kumbudila Chapanga wavi.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Mambu goha ago gahumalili muni kutimilisa malovi ga Bambu geajovili munjila ya mlota wa Chapanga, <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Yuwanila! Kamwali yati ivya na ndumbu, yati iveleka mwana mgosi, na veve yati ukumpela liina Emanueli.” Mana yaki “Chapanga avi pamonga na tete.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Ndi Yosefu peayumwiki mulugono akitili ngati mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga cheamjovili, akamtola mdala waki na kuhamba nayu kunyumba yaki. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Nambu agonili nayu lepi mbaka Maliya peamveliki mwana mgosi, namwene Yosefu ampeli liina Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Vayehe kuhuma kwe lihumila lilanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Hinu Yesu avelikiwi kumuji wa Betelehemu, mulima wa Yudea lukumbi lwa ulongosi wa nkosi Helodi. Bahapo peamali kuvelekwa vevimanya mambu ga ndondo kuhuma kwe lihumila lilanga vabwelili ku Yelusalemu, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />vakavakota vandu, “Avi koki mwana yula, mweavelikwi kuvya Nkosi wa Vayawudi? Tiyiweni ndondo yaki yeyahumali kwe lihumila lilanga, na tete tibwelii kumgundamila.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Nkosi Helodi peayuwini ago, akavagaya mwene pamonga na vandu voha vevitama pa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Hinu akavakemela pamonga vamteta vakulu va Chapanga voha na vawula va Malagizu, akavakota, “Wu, Kilisitu Msangula yati ivelekewa koki?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Vene vakamyangula, “Muji wa Betelehemu mulima wa Yudea, ngati cheayandiki mlota wa Chapanga,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‘Veve muji wa Betelehemu mulima wa Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">veve katu wamdebe lepi mumiji yivaha ya Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">muni kwa veve yati ihumila chilongosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">mweilongosa vandu vangu, Isilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Hinu, Helodi avakemili kuchiyepela vandu vala vevimanya mambu ga ndondo avakotakisi lukumbi chakaka ndondo payavaumalili. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Kangi akavatuma kuhamba ku Betelehemu avajovili, “Muhamba mkakotakesa chamugati malovi ga mwana uyo. Ngati mumuwene mbwela kunijovela, muni mewawa na nene niamba kumgundamila.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Vala vevimanya mambu ga ndondo, pevamali kumyuwanila nkosi vakahamba. Ndondo yevayiwene kwelihumila lilanga yavalongolili yahambili kuyima panani pandu pala peavi mwana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Pavayiwene ndondo yila, vavi na luheku neju. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Hinu vakayingila mugati, vakamlola mwana pamonga na Maliya nyina mwana, vakafugama na kumgundamila. Kangi vakawopola tuhaku vakatola njombi na vakampela zahabu na ubani na mahuta gegikemiwa manemane.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Chapanga avabesili munjozi vakotoka kumuwuyila Helodi, ndi vakawuya kumulima wavi munjila yingi.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutilila ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Pavawukili vayehe vala, mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga amuhumalili Yosefu munjozi, akamjovela, “Yimuka! Mtola mwana pamonga na nyina waki, mtilila ku Misili. Mkatama kwenuko mbaka panikuvajovela muni Helodi igana kumkoma mwana uyo.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Yosefu ayumwiki, akamtola mwana pamonga na nyina waki akawuka kilu yila, akahamba ku Misili. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Akatama kwenuko mbaka Helodi peafwili. Lijambu lenili lakitiki muni linenu leajovili Bambu munjila ya mlota wa Chapanga litimilayi, “Namkemili mwana vangu awuya kuhuma ku Misili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vana vadebe vikomiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Helodi peamanyili kuvya vala vevimanya mambu ga ndondo vamkongili, akamema ligoga. Akavatuma vandu vaki vahamba kuvakoma vana vagosi voha pamuji wa Betelehemu na mumihana yaki vevavi na umuli wa miaka yivili na kuhelela vakomiwayi. Akitili genago ndava ya lukumbi lula lweajoviwi na vandu vala vevamanyili mambu ga ndondo.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Ndi chagatimili malovi geajovili Yelemia mweavi mlota wa Chapanga,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Lwami luyuwanika kumuji wa Lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Chivembu cha mvinisu ukulu na kuwombeleza pamahele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Laheli akuvavembela vana vaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Na ibela kupoleswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">muni voha vafwili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Hinu, Helodi peafwili mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga amuhumalili Yosefu munjozi ku Misili kula, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />amjovili “Wuka! Mtola mwana na nyina waki, uwuya kavili kumulima wa Isilaeli, ndava vevaganayi kumkoma mwana vafwili.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Yosefu akawuka, akamtola mwana pamonga na nyina waki akawuya pamulima wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Nambu Yosefu peayuwini kuvya Alikelao, mwana wa Helodi, ahalili unkosi wa Yudea pahali pa dadi waki, ayogwipi kuhamba kwenuko. Namwene peamali kubesewa munjozi, akahamba pamulima wa Galilaya, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />akahamalila kumuji weukemelewa Nazaleti. Ndi chagatimalili malovi gegajoviki munjila ya vamlota va Chapanga, “Yati ikemiwa mundu wa ku Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohani Mbatizaji akuvakokosela vandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohani 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Lukumbi lwenulo Yohani Mbatizaji ahambili kulugangatu lwa Yudea akatumbula kuvakokosela vandu. <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />Akajova, “Mumuwuyila Chapanga muni Unkosi wa Kunani kwa Chapanga uvi papipi.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Yohani mwenuyo ndi yula Isaya mweavi mlota wa Chapanga ajovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Mundu ijova kwa lwami kulugangatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">Mumtendelekela Bambu njila yaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">mugolosa njila yaki!”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yohani awalii nyula yevatotili mangoma ga hinyama yeyikemiwa ngamiya, mkungi wa chikumba muchiwunu chaki. Chakulya chaki chavi mambalanguli na wuchi. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Hinu vandu kuhuma ku Yelusalemu na kuhuma milima yoha yeyivii papipi na Yudea na mumihana ya mfuleni Yoludani vamhambalili. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Vakagajova hotohoto gevambudili Chapanga. Namwene avabatizi mumfuleni Yoludani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Nambu peavaweni Vafalisayu na Vasadukayu vamahele vakumbwelela muni avabatizayi, mwene avajovili, “Nyenye chiveleku cha liyoka! Yani mweavajovili muhotola kutila ligoga la Chapanga lelibwela? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Mulangisa mumatendu ginu kuvya mukotwiki kumbudila kwinu Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Nakuhololela mwihotola kutila ligoga la Chapanga cha kujova kuvya ndi nyenye vana va Ibulahimu nikuvajovela chakaka Chapanga ihotola kutola aga maganga na kugakita kuvya vana va Ibulahimu. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Hinu livagu litendelekiwi mumikiga ya mikongo, mkongo wowoha wangapambika matunda gabwina yati udumuliwa na kutagiwa kumotu. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Nene nikuvabatiza kwa manji kulangisa kuvya mkotwiki kumbudila kwinu Chapanga. Nambu mweibwela mumbele ya nene yati akuvabatiza kwa Mpungu Msopi na motu. Mwene anamkakala kuliku nene na nene niganikiwa lepi hati kugega champali zaki. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Mwene ikamula lupalu lwa kupepetela nganu mu mawoko gaki muni apepeta nganu yaki na kuvika muchibana nambu masasa akugayocha pamotu wangajimika.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubatiziwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maluko 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Lukumbi lwenulo Yesu ahumili ku Galilaya akahika kumfuleni Yoludani, muni abatiziwa na Yohani. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Nambu Yohani alingili kumbesa amjovili, “Wu, veve, ubwela kwa nene? Yikunigana nene nibatiziwayi na veve!”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Nambu Yesu akayangula, “Yidakila kukita genaga hinu, kwa njila yeniyi ndi cheiganikiwa kuhenga goha geigana Chapanga.” Bahapo ndi Yohani akayidakila.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Yesu peamali kubatiziwa na kuhuma mumanji bahapo kunani kwa Chapanga kwadindwiki, akalola Mpungu wa Chapanga ihelela ngati ngunda na kutula panani yaki. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Kangi lwami kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga lukajova, “Mwenuyu ndi Mwana vangu mganu, mweniganisiwi nayu.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ilingiwa na Setani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maluko 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Kangi Mpungu Msopi wamlongwisi Yesu mbaka kulugangatu muni alingiwa na Setani. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Ajihinisi chakulya lukumbi lwa magono alobaini kilu na muhi pamwishu njala yamvinili. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Hinu Setani akabwela na kumjovela, “Ngati veve wa Mwana wa Chapanga amula aga maganga gavyai libumunda.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Nambu Yesu akayangula, “Yiyandikwi mu Mayandiku Gamsopi, ‘Mundu itama lepi ndava ya libumunda lene, nambu kwa kulanda kila linenu leijova Chapanga.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Kangi Setani akamtola Yesu mbaka Yelusalemu weuvi muji wa msopi, akamkita ayima panani pa chituvilu cha Nyumba ya Chapanga, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />akamjovela, “Ngati veve mwana wa Chapanga ujitagayi pahi, ndava vayandiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Chapanga akuvalagazila vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga ndava yaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Yati vakukuyanga mu mawoko gavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">ukotoka kujikuvala chigendelu chaku paliganga.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu akamyangula, mewawa “Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova, ‘Kotoka kumlinga Bambu Chapanga waku.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Kangi Setani akamtola na kuhamba nayu panani pachitumbi chitali, na kumlangisa unkosi woha wa pamulima na ukulu waki, <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />akamjovela, “Goha aga yati nikupela, ngati ukunigundamila na kunifugamila.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Penapo, Yesu akayangula, “Wuka Setani! Vayandiki, mu Mayandiku Gamsopi yati ‘Umgundamila Bambu Chapanga waku, na kumhengela mwene ndu!’”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Hinu Setani, akamleka Yesu na vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga vakabwela vakamhengela.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu itumbula lihengu laki ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maluko 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yesu peayuwini kuvya Yohani vamkungili muchifungu akahamba ku Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Akawuka ku Nazaleti akahamba ku Kapelanaumu, muji wa kumwambu ya nyanja Galilaya mumilima ya Zebuloni na Nafutali, akatama kwenuko. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Ndi gatimili gala geajovili Isaya, mweavi mlota wa Chapanga,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Mulima wa Zebuloni na mulima wa Nafutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">njila ya kuhamba kunyanja mwambu ya mumfuleni Yoludani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilaya muji wa vandu vangali Vayawudi!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Vandu vevatami kuchitita.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Vauweni lumuli luvaha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Vene vitama mumuji wa chitita na chimuwili cha lifwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">lumuli luvalangasili.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kuhumila lukumbi lwenulo Yesu atumbwili kukokosa, “Mumuwuyila Chapanga, muni Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga uvi papipi!”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu avakemela vevilova somba mcheche</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maluko 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yesu peagendayi mumhana wa nyanja Galilaya, avaweni valongo vavili vevilova somba Simoni, mweikemiwa Petili na Andelea mlongo waki, valova somba na ngwanda munyanja ndava vavi valova. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yesu akavajovela, ngati chamwilova somba, “Munilandayi, nene yati nikuvakita nyenye kuvya vakuvaleta vandu kwa Bambu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Bahapo vazilekili ngwanda zavi, vakamlanda.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Peahegalili kulongolo, avaweni valongo vangi vavili, Yakobo na Yohani, vana va Zebedayo. Vene vavi mugati ya watu pamonga na dadi wavi Zebedayo, vatengenezayi ngwanda za kulovela somba. Yesu akavakemela, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />navene kanyata vakauleka watu pamonga na dadi wavi, vakamlanda Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalamisa vatamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu ahambili kila pandu ku Galilaya, iwula munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi na kuvakokosela Linenu la Bwina la Unkosi wa Chapanga. Akavalamisa matamu ndalindali gevavi nagu vandu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Malovi gaki gadandasiki pandi zoha za ku Silia. Vandu voha vevavi na matamu na mang'ahiso, mewa vevatalaliwi na mizuka na vevihinduka na vevagogodili higa vavapeliki kwaki na mwene akavalamisa. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Msambi wa vandu kuhuma ku Galilaya na Dekapoli ndi miji kumi, mewa Yelusalemu na Yudea na kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani vakamlanda.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvakokosela vandu pachitumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yesu peauwene msambi wa vandu, akakwela kuchitumbi, akatama. Vawuliwa vaki vakamlanda, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />mwene akatumbula kuvawula, akajova.<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luheku lwa chakaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />Vamotisiwa vevavi vangangu mumpungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">muni Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga ndi wavi!<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Vamotisiwa vana mvinisu mumtima ndava vambudili Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">muni Chapanga alavapolesa mitima!<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Vamotisiwa vangolongondi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">muni valahala mulima.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Vamotisiwa vana njala na vevavi na njota ya kukita geigana Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">muni Chapanga alavayukutisa<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Vamotisiwi vevavi na lipyana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">muni Chapanga alavahengela lipyana.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Vamotisiwi vevavi na mtima wa msopi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">muni yati valamuwona Chapanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Vamotisiwi vatepulanisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">muni yati vikemelewa vana vaki Chapanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Vamotisiwi veving'aiswa ndava ya kukita geigana Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">muni Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga ndi wa vene.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Mumotisiwi nyenye vandu vakavaliga, vakavanyagayi na kuvadetela uhakau ndava ya nene. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Mheka na kululuta muni njombi yinu yivaha kunani kwa Chapanga, chenichi ndi chevavahengili Vamlota va Chapanga vevavalongolili kwakona nyenye.”<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwinyu na lumuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maluko 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />Nyenye ndi mwinyu wa pamulima! Nambu luyong'onyo lwaki lwakayaga yati yisopewa kiki? Yivya lepi na lihengu kavili yati kutagika kuvala na vandu vakuyilivatila.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Nyenye ndi ngati lumuli lwa pamulima! Muji weujengiwi panani ya chitumbi ufiyika lepi. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Vandu vipambika lepi hahi na kuigubika na chiviga, muni yivikiwa panani ya chibokoselu kuvalangasa voha vevavi mugati. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Mewawa lumuli lwinu luvalangasa palongolo ya vandu, vagalola matendu ginu gabwina, vamlumbalila Dadi winu mweavi kunani.”<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu ndava ya Malagizu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Mkoto kuhololela kuvya nibweli kuwusa malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa amala mawuliwu ga Vamlota va Chapanga. Nibweli lepi kuwusa, ndi nibweli muni kugatimalisa. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Nikujovela chakaka, mbaka kunani na mulima yati zihamba, kawaka hati nukuta yimonga yeyiwusiwa mumalagizu mbaka goha gatimila. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Hinu, mundu yeyoha angayidakila hati mihilu umonga udebe kuliku zoha, na kuvawula vangi vakita ago, mwenuyo yati ivya mdebe neju, Muunkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga. Nambu mweiyuwanila na kuvawula vangi mwenuyo yati ivya mvaha muunkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Muyuwanila, ubwina winu ngati nakuyonjokesa wula wa vawula va malagizu na Vafalisayu, katu nakuyingila mu Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liwulo la kuyepa ligoga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luka 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mmali kuyuwana kuvya vandu va kadeni chavajoviwi, ‘Ukoto kukoma! Mundu yeyoha mweikoma yikumgana ahamuliwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Nambu nene nikuvajovela, mundu yeyoha mweakumyomela mlongo waki, yati ihamuliwa. Mundu yeyoha mweakumvevesa mlongo waki yati vakumtakila kulibanji la mihalu. Mweakumkemela mlongo waki, ‘Myimu! Yati iyingila kumotu wa magono goha wangajimika.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />“Hinu, ngati upeleka luteta lwaku palongolo ya pandu pa kuwusila teta, na ukumbwiki kuvya mlongo waku avi na luhonda na veve, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />Ululeka luteta lwaku panani ya pandu pa kuwusila teta, hamba hoti ukatepulana na mlongo waku kangi uwuya kavili uwusa luteta lwaku.”<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Tepulana na mweakutakili kanyata mwakona munjila kuhamba kulibanji la mihalu. Ngati lepi, mweakutakili yati akukugotola mumawoko ga mhamula mihalu, mwene akugotola kwa manjolinjoli na kukungiwa muchifungu. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Nikujovela chakaka yati nakuhuma mbaka ulipili sendi ya mwishu.”<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu ga kubesa ugoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Muyuwini kuvya vandu vajoviwi, kotoka kukita ugoni! <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Nambu nene nikuvajovela, kila mundu mweakumlolokesa mdala cha kumnogela amali kugona nayu mumtima waki. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Hinu, lihu laku la upandi wa kulyelela likakubudisa, ulitupula ukalitaga kutali. Mbanga neju, veve kuyaganisa pandu pamonga pa higa yaku, kuliku higa yaku yoha kutagika pamotu wa magono goha wangajimika. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Ngati chiwoko chaku cha kulyela chikubudisa chidumulai ukatagayi kutali. Mbanga veve kuyaganisa pandu pamonga pa higa yaku kuliku higa yaku yoha yihambi kumotu wa magono goha wangajimika.”<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu ga kubesa kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matei 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maluko 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Gamali kujovekwa kuvya, ‘Mundu yeyoha mweakumleka mdala waki, amyandakila balua ya kumleka.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Nambu nene nikuvajovela, mundu yeyoha mweakumleka mdala waki, nambu ndu ndava ya kumkamula ugoni, akumkita mkemi. Na mgosi akamgegai mdala yula mwealekiwi ikita ugoni nayu.”<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu ga kubesa kulapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Kangi myuwini vandu va kadeni vajoviwi, ‘Ukotoka kudenya chilapu chaku, nambu uganikiwa kutimilisa chilapu chaku kwa Bambu.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Nambu nene nikuvajovela, katu mkotoka kulapa, hati kunani kwa Chapanga, muni ndi chigoda cha Chapanga cha unkosi waki, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />amala kulapa kwa mulima muni chigoda cha kuvikila magendelu gaki, amala ku Yelusalemu muni muji wa Nkosi mkulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Ukoto kulapa pamutu waku, muni nakuhotola kuuhenga hati luyunju lumonga kuvya lwa msopi amala lutitu. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Mkajovai ‘Ena,’ Ndi yivya ‘Ena,’ Mkajovai, ‘Mbwitu,’ Chakaka yivyai ‘Mbwitu,’ Chochoha chechiyonjokeseka pa genago chihumila kwa Setani.”<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu ndava ya kumulipisa mweakubudili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Muyuwini kuvya gajoviki. ‘Lihu kwa lihu, linu kwa linu.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Nambu nene nikuvajovela, ukotoka kumuwuyisila mundu mhakau. Mundu akakupamanda, mulitama la kulyela, mng'anamusila na litama la kumangeya. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Mundu akakutakila igana kukunyaga nyula yaku, mlekela atola mewa na likoti laku. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Mundu akakukamula kwa makakala ugegai ndwika yaki kilomita yimonga, ugegai kilomita zivili. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Mweakukuyupa mpelai, na ukotoka kumtila mundu mweakuyaika chindu.”<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu ga kuvagana makoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luka 6:27-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Myuwini kuvya gajoviki, mgana muyaku, na mvenga likoko waku. <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Nambu nene nikuvajovela, muvagana makoko vinu na kuvayupila vala vevakuvang'aisa nyenye, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />muni mpata kuvya vana va Dadi winu mweavi kunani. Muni mwene akuvalangasila lilanga laki vandu makoko na vandu vabwina, na kuvatonyela fula kwa vandu vabwina palongolo yaki na vandu vahakau. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Wu, njombi yoki mwipata kuhuma kwa Chapanga? Ngati mukuvagana vala vevakuvagana nyenye ndu! Kawaka! Muni hati vatola kodi navene vikita mewa! <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Ngati Mukuvajambusa valongo vinu ndu, mhengili chindu kiki neju kuliku vangi? Muni hati vangammanya Chapanga vikita mewawa. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Mwiganikiwa mkoto kupungula chochoa mukuhenga gabwina ngati Dadi winu wa kunani kwa Chapanga angapungula.”<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu ndava ya kuvatangatila vangangu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Mjiyangalila mkoto kukita matendu ginu gabwina pamihu ga vandu, ndava ya kujilangisa kwavi. Ndava muni mwakakita genago mwipata lepi njombi kuhuma kwa Dadi winu mweavi kunani.”<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Hinu, mukavatangatila vangangu, ukoto kujikokosa kotoka kukita ngati vandu vevakujikita kuvya vabwina munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi na munjila muni vandu vavalumba. Nikuvajovela chakaka venavo vamali kupewa njombi yavi. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Nambu veve peukumtangatila mngangu, kita jambu lenilo cha mfiyu hati vandu vangi vakotoka kumanya chewihenga. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Mpela luteta lwaku chamfiyu na Dadi waku akugalola gegafiyiki yati akukupela njombi.”<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu ndava ya kumuyupa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />Pemwiyupa kwa Chapanga, mkotoka kuvya ngati vandu vavakujikita kuvya vabwina, vene vigana kuyima munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi na malekanganu ga njila, muni vandu vavalola. Nikuvajovela chakaka vene vamali kupewa njombi yavi. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Nambu veve peukumuyupa Chapanga, uyingila muchumba chaku, dinda mlyangu, uyupa kwa Dadi winu mweangalolekana. Mwene Dadi waku akugalola gegafiyiki, yati akukupela njombi.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Pemwikumuyupa Chapanga, mkoto kujovajova malovi gamahele ngati vandu vangammanya Chapanga. Muni vene vihololela kuvya Chapanga alavayuwanila ndava ya malovi gavi gamahele. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Mkoto kuwanangana nawu. Dadi winu achimanyili chamwigana hati mwakona mwangayupa. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Hinu, nyenye pemkuyumpa Chapanga, mjova naha:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Dadi witu wewitama kunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Liina laku lilumbiwa neju.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Unkosi waku utibwelelai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">chewigana veve chikitika, pamulima apa ngati cheyivii kunani kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Utipela lelu chakulya chitu cha magono goha.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Utilekekesa tete getihokili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">ngati tete chetikuvalekekesa vevatihokili.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Ukotoka kutiyingisa mukulingiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">nambu utisangula na mhakau yula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">Ndava muni Unkosi na ukulu na makakala ndi vyaku hati magono goha gangali na mwishu.<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Ngati mwakavalekekesa vandu kuhoka kwavi, Dadi winu wa kunani alavalekekesa nyenye mewawa mukumbudila kwinu. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Nambu ngati nakuvalekekesa vangi kuhoka kwavi, mewawa Dadi winu alavalekekesa lepi nyenye kumbudila kwinu.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu ga kujihinisa kulya chakulya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />Pemukujihisa kulya chakulya ndava ya Bambu, mkoto kulangisa ungolongondi ngati vandu vevakujikita kuvya vabwina, vene vikwinyana pamihu pavi, muni vawonekana pavandu ngati vajihinisi kulya chakulya ndava ya Bambu. Nikuvajovela chakaka venavo vamali kupata njombi yavi. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Nambu veve peukujihinisa kulya chakulya ndava ya Bambu, samba manji pamihu na unyala mahuta pamutu. <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />Muni mundu yeyoha akotoka kumanya kuvya kujihisa kulya chakulya, ndi umanyikana kwa Dadi waku ndu mweangalolekana. Namwene akugalola gegafiyiki, yati akupela njombi.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu ga kujivikila chibana kunani kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />Mkoto kuvika vibana apa pamulima, ndava vingokoko amala kutu vihalibu na vahiji videnya na kuyiva. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Nambu mjivikila vibana vinu kunani kwa Chapanga kwenuko vingokoko amala kutu nakuhalabika na amala vahiji videnuya lepi na kuyiva. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Muni pala pemwivika vibana vinu ndi pewivya mtima waku.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lumuli lwa higa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />Lihu laku ndi hahi ya higa yaku, ngati lihu laku lilola bwina, higa yaku yoha yivya mulumuli, <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />nambu ngati lihu laku lilola lepi bwina, ndi higa yaku yoha yivya muchitita. Hinu, chilanga chechivii mugati yaku chikavya chitita, chakaka cheni ndi chitita chivaha neju!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu mweavi na vindu vyamahele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2-31">12:2-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />Avi lepi mvanda, mweihotola kuvahengela vabambu vavili. Muni yati akumgana mmonga na kumvenga yungi, yati akumgana neju mmonga na kumvevesa yungi. Mwihotola lepi kumhengela Chapanga na bahapo kuhengela vindu vyamahele.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />Ndi nikuvajovela, mkoto kutyalatyala ndava ya chakulya na chemwinywa vyamgana muni mutama, amala ndava ya nyula zemwigana ndava ya higa yinu. Wu, wumi chindu chivaha lepi kuliku chakulya? Na higa ndi ya maana lepi kuliku nyula? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Mlola videge, vimija lepi amala kubena mewa vivi lepi na chibana chochoha. Pamonga na ago Dadi winu mweavi kunani akuvapela chakulya. Wu, nyenye chindu chivaha lepi kuliku videge? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Yani pagati yinu ndava ya kutyalatyala neju ihotola kuyonjokesa hati lukumbi ludebe lwa wumi waki?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />Ndava kyani, kutyalatyala ndava ya nyula? Mlola maluva ga mudahi cheginyamba. Gihenga lepi lihengu amala gitota lepi nyula. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Nambu nikuvajovela, hati mwene Solomoni na unkosi waki awali lepi chakunyamba ngati limonga pagati ya maluva aga. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Ngati Chapanga akuliwalika linyai la kumgunda, nambu lelu livii na chilau kutaga kumotu, wu, nakuvahengela neju nyenye? Nyenye vandu mwemusadika padebe!<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Hinu, mkoto kutyalatyala, yati tilya kiki? Yati tinywa kiki? Tiwala kyani? <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Muni ago goha gitangatiliwa na vandu vangamlanda Chapanga. Dadi winu mweavi kunani amanyili kuvya mwigana goha ago. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Ndi, mlonda hoti Unkosi waki Chapanga na geigana, na genago goha yati akuvayonjokesa. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Hinu mkoto kutyalatyala ndava ya chilau. Chilau yivii gaki, mang'ahiso ga ligono limonga gakuvakola.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Kuvahamula vangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luka 6:37-38</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Mkoto kuvahamula vangi, muni na nyenye yati mwihamuliwa lepi na Chapanga, <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Ndava muni chemukuvahamula vangi, na nyenye yati mwihamuliwa, na chipimu chilachila cha mwihengela kwa vangi, ndi Chapanga yati avahengela nyenye. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Ndava kyani wilola lungoda mulihu la mlongo waku, na kuni wangaluwona lumbagalu mulihu laku? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Amala yati wijova wuli, kwa mlongo waku, ‘Linda hoti, nikuwusa lungoda mulihu laku,’ Kuni wamwene una lumbagalu mulihu laku? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Veve mweukujikita kuvya mbwina! Wusa hoti lumbagalu lweluvi mulihu laku. Pena ndi peuhotola kulola bwina kuwusa lungoda mulihu la mlongo waku.”<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Mkoto kugapela mabwa vindu vyamsopi vakotoka kung'anamuka na kuvalemasa mwavene, amala mkoto kugapela maguluvi lulu zeziguliswa kwa mashonga gamahele muni vakotoka kulivatila kwa magendelu gavi.”<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yupa na londa na hodisa mlyangu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Muyupa yati mwipewa, mlondai yati mwipata, muhodisa mlyangu yati vakuvadindulila. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Ndava muni mweiyupa ipewa na mweilonda yati ipata na mweihodisa mlyangu yati idinduliliwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Wu, avi mmonga pagati yinu, ngati mwana waki akamuyupa libumunda akumpela liganga? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Amala akamuyupa somba akumpela liyoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Ngati hinu nyenye, mwavahakau, mwimanya kuvapela vana vinu vindu vyabwina, chakaka Dadi winu wa kunani akuvahengela neju akuvapela vindu vyabwina, vala vevakumuyupa.”<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />“Goha gemwigana vandu vavahengela nyenye, mvahengela na vene mewawa. Yeniyi ndi maana ya Malagizu ga Bambu geampeli Musa na mawuliwu ga vamlota va Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlyangu ngalingasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Muyingila kwa kupitila mlyangu udebe. Ndava muni njila yeyilongosa mukuyongomela ndi yipana na mlyangu waki ndi upana, veviyingila mwenumo ndi vamahele. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Nambu njila yeyilongosa kuyingila kuwumi wa magono goha ndi ngalingasi na mlyangu waki ungalingasi, vandu vamahele lepi vevihotola kumanya njila yeniyi.”<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkongo na matunda gaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luka 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Mujiyangalila na vamlota va udesi, vene vibwela kwinu vakujilangisa cha kuvala ngati limbelele, nambu chamugati ndi libwa likali la kudahi. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Mukuvamanya ndava ya matendu gavi. Wu, vandu viyava matunda ga zabibu mumkongo wa minga amala tini mumkongo wa minga? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Mewawa ndi kila mkongo wabwina wipambika matunda gabwina, na mkongo uhakau wipambika matunda gahakau. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Mkongo wabwina nakuhotola kupambika matunda gahakau, kavili mkongo mhakau nakupambika matunda gabwina. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Kila mkongo wangapambika matunda gabwina yati udumuliwa na kutagiwa kumotu. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Hinu, mukuvamanya ndava ya matendu gavi.”<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nivamanyi lepi nyenye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Lepi kila mundu mweakunikemela, ‘Bambu, Bambu,’ Yati iyingila Muunkosi wa Chapanga. Nambu ngayula mweihenga geigana Dadi wangu mweavi kunani.” <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Vamahele, “Yati vakunijovela, ‘Ligono lila la uhamula wa Bambu, Bambu! Paliina laku tavakokosili vandu ujumbi waku, na paliina laku tavawusili vandu mizuka na kukita gachinamtiti yamahele.’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Kangi yati nikuvajovela, katu nakuvamanya nyenye, muwuka palongolo yangu mwemuhenga gahakau!”<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vandu vavili vevijenga nyumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Hinu mundu yeyoha mweiyuwana malovi gangu na kugahenga, iwanangana na mundu mweavi na luhala lwabwina, mweajengili nyumba yaki panani ya litalau. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Fula yikatonya na mifuleni yikamema manji gamahele, mpungu wakabwela na kuyitova nyumba yeniyo. Nambu nyumba yeniyo nakugwa ndava yijengiwi panani ya litalau.”<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Nambu mundu yeyoha mweiyuwana malovi gangu na ibela kugahenga, iwanangana na mundu myimu mweijenga nyumba yaki panani ya msavati. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Fula yikatonya na mifuleni yikamema manji gamahele na mpungu ukabwela na kuitova nyumba yeniyo, nayene yikagwa na kudenyekana neju!”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhotola wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Yesu peamali kujova malovi ago, msambi wa vandu ukakangaswa ndava ya mawuliwu gaki. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Muni awulayi ngati mundu mweavi na uhotola ndi lepi ngati vawula vavi va malagizu.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mundu anamabudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maluko 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yesu peahelili kuhuma kuchitumbi, msambi wa vandu wamlandili. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Hinu abwelili mundu mmonga mweavi na mabudi, akamfugamila na kujova, “Bambu, ngati wigana, uhotola kuninyambisa!” <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu akatalambula chiwoko, akampamisa na kujova, “Nigana! Unyambasika!” Bahapo mundu yula akalama mabudi gaki. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Kangi Yesu akamjovela, “Yuwanila! Kotoka kumjovela mundu yeyoha yula, ndi uhamba ukajilangisa kwa mteta wa Chapanga na kumpela teta ngati chealagizi Musa ya kulangisa kuvya unyambiswi.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadika ya chilongosi mmonga wa Chilumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Yesu peayingili ku Kapelanaumu, mkulu wa manjolinjoli mmonga wa Loma akambwelela na kujova amtangatila, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />akamjovela “Bambu mtumisi wangu agonili munyumba, ana utamu wa kupola na iviniswa neju.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu akamjovela, “Yati nibwela kumlamisa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Mkulu wa manjolinjoli yula akajova, “Bambu, nigana lepi veve kuyingila munyumba yangu. Nambu ujova ndu linenu na mtumisi wangu yati ilama. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Muni, hati namwene namundu mwenivii pahi ya uhotola wa vakulu vangu na nivii na manjolinjoli pahi yangu. Nikuvalagiza manjolinjoli vevavi pahi yangu. Nikumjovela mmonga, ‘Amba!’ Ihamba, na yungi, ‘Bwela,’ Ndi ibwela na mtumisi wangu, henga aga! Namwene ihenga mewa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu peayuwini malovi ago akakangasa neju, akavajovela vandu vevamlandai vala, “Nikuvajovela chakaka, niwene lepi mundu mweavi na sadika yivaha ngati mwenuyu pa Isilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Hinu, nikuvajovela vandu vamahele valabwela kuhuma kwe lihumila lilanga na kuhuma kwa litipama lilanga, vene valatama pamselebuko wa chakulya pamonga na Ibulahimu na Izaki na Yakobo. Muunkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Nambu vala vevaganikiwi kuvya muunkosi wenuwo yati vakuvataga kuvala, kuchitita, kwenuko yati vivemba na kuyaga minu.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Kangi, Yesu amjovili mkulu wa manjolinjoli wa ku Loma, “Wuya kunyumba, gavyai mewa ngati cheusadika.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">Ndi mtumisi waki alamili lukumbi lulalula.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalamisa vandu vamahele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maluko 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yesu ahikili panyumba ya Petili, amkolili nyina wa mdala waki Petili agonili pachitanda, ndava ya utamu. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Hinu, Yesu akampamisa mau yula chiwoko, na utamu waki wamlekili, akayima kumtelekela.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Payavi kimihi, vamletili vandu vamahele vevatalaliwi na mizuka, mwene ayivingili mizuka kwa njila ya mawuliwu gaki. Ndi avalamisi vandu voha vevavi na utamu. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Akitili chenicho, muni gatimila malovi geajovili Isaya mweavi mlota wa Chapanga, “Mwene atolili mang'ahiso gitu na ulenda witu, na kugega matamu gitu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vevigana kumlanda Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yesu paauweni msambi wa vandu umtindili, akavalagiza vawuliwa vaki vakupuka kuhamba kumwambu ya nyanja. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Muwula mmonga wa Malagizu amhambili Yesu, akamjovela, “Muwula, nene yati nikukulanda kwokwoha kwewihamba.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu akayangula, “Lihogo lina mbugu na videge vina hisakanilu, nambu Mwana wa Mundu avi lepi na pandu pa kupumulila.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Mundu yungi pagati ya vawuliwa vaki akamjovela, “Bambu, nileka hoti nihamba nikamuzika Dadi wangu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Nambu Yesu akamyangula, “Unilanda, valeka vevafwili vavazika vandu vavi vevafwili.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu igunisa mpungu uvaha neju</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maluko 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Yesu akayingila muwatu na vawuliwa vaki vakahamba pamonga nayu. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Bahapo chimbungululu chivaha neju chikahumalila na manji gakatimbugana neju, hati gakatumbula kuugubika watu, nambu Yesu avi mulugono. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Vawuliwa vakamhambila na kumuyumusa peagonili vakamjovela, “Bambu!” “Utisangula tifwa!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yesu akavajovela, “Nyenye vandu mwemusadika padebe! Ndava kyani muyogopa?” Hinu akayima akahakalila mpungu na manji gakutimbugana neju na nyanja yikaguna kukavya nuu. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Vandu vakakangasa na kujova “Wu, mundu mwenuyu avi wuli? Hati mpungu na manji gakutimbugana neju vikumyidikila!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalamisa vandu vavili vana mizuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maluko 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Yesu peakupwiki kumwambu ya nyanja akahika pamulima wa Wagadala, kwenuko akonganiki na vandu vavili vana mizuka vihumila kumatinda. Vandu venavo vavi na mizuka ya kuyogofya neju. Hati vandu valingili lepi kupita njila yeniyo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Vakaywanga vijova, “Una kyani na tete veve Mwana wa Chapanga? Ubweli kutilemasa kwakona hati lukumbi lwitu?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Papipi na penapo kwavili na msambi wa maguluvi gegilya. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Hinu penapo mizuka yila yikamjovela Yesu, “Ngati ukutiwusa, tileka tihamba tikayingili mumsambi wa maguluvi gala.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yesu akayangula “Ena muhamba.” Penapo gakawuka kwa vandu na kugayingila maguluvi. Msambi woha wa maguluvi wajumbili pamuhelelu na kujwigama munyaja, ndi goha gafwili mumanji.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Vala vadimaji va maguluvi, vajumbili na kuhamba kumuji. Ndi vavadandaulili malovi na mambu gegavakolili vandu vavili vala vevatalaliwi na mizuka. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Hinu, vandu voha pamuji wula, vakawuka vakamhambila Yesu, pevamuweni vakamgana, awukayi pamulima wavi.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mundu mweapoli higa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maluko 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu akayingila muwatu na kukupuka munyanja na kuhika kumuji wavi. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Penapo vandu vamletili mundu mmonga mweapoli higa, vamgonisi pa lusongwani. Yesu paavaweni chavisadika, akamjovela mundu mweapoli yula, “Jipolesa mtima mwana vangu! Kumbudila kwaku Chapanga ulekekiswi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Vawula vangi va malagizu vakatumbula kuhololela, “Mundu uyu akumliga Chapanga!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Yesu amanyili maholo gavi akajova, “Ndava kyani mhololela gahakau mumtima winu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Chinonopa kiki kujova, ‘Ulekekiswi kumbudila Chapanga waku,’ Amala kujova, ‘Yima, ugenda?’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Hinu, nigana mmanya kuvya Mwana wa Mundu anauhotola pamulima kuvalekekesa vandu gevambudili Chapanga.” Penapo ndi akamjovela mundu mweapoli yula, “Yima ugega lusongwani lwaku amba kunyumba yaku!”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Na mundu mwenuyo akawuka na kuhamba kunyumba yaki. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Msambi wa vandu wula pevagaweni ago, vakakangasa na kuyogopa, vakamulumbalila Chapanga mweavapelii vandu uhotola wenuwu.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumkemela Matei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maluko 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu akawuka penapo, ndi peavili mukuhamba amuwene mundu mmonga mweikemiwa Matei, atamili munyumba ya kutolela kodi. Hinu, Yesu amjovili, “Unilanda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Namwene akayima na kumlanda.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yesu peatamili munyumba ya Matei, kulya chakulya, vatola kodi vamahele na vevakumbudila Chapanga vabwelili kulya nayu, pamonga na vawuliwa vaki. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Pagati ya Vafalisayu vangi pavagaweni genago, vakavakota vawuliwa vaki, “Ndava kyani muwula winu ilya pamonga na vatola kodi na vandu vevakumbudila Chapanga?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yesu akavayuwana, akayangula, “Vandu vangalwala nakugana mlamisa, nambu vana matamu ndi vakumgana mlamisa. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Hinu mukajiwula malovi aga mana yaki kyani, ‘Nigana lipyana, lepi luteta lwa kutinyisa.’ Nibweli lepi kuvakemela vandu vevihenga matendu gabwina palongolo ya Chapanga, nambu ndava ya vevakumbudila Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu ndava ya kujihinisa kulya chakulya ndava ya Bambu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maluko 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Kangi, vawuliwa va Yohani Mbatizaji vamubwelili Yesu, vakamkota, “Tete na Vafalisayu tikujihinisa kulya chakulya pamahele ndava ya Bambu. Ndava kyani vawuliwa vaku vakujihinisa lepi kulya chakulya?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu akayangula, “Wu, vandu vevagongoliwi kumselebuko wa pandowa yihotoleka vatama ngolongondi kuni vavi pamonga na mkolo ndowa? Lepi, nambu lwalabwela lukumbi lwa mkolo ndowa kuwusiwa, lwenulo ndi lukumbi lwavene kujihinisa kulya chakulya.”<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Vandu vitota lepi chilaka cha nyula ya mupya munyula ya lindimula. Muni chilaka chenicho yati chipapula neju nyula lindimula na pandu pala yati piyonjokeseka neju kupapuka. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Vandu nakusopa divayi ya mupya muchihaku cha chikumba chechilali. Ngati vasopii muchihaku cha chikumba chechilali yati chibayuka na divayi yati yiyitika. Nambu vandu visopa divayi ya mupya muchihaku cha chikumba cha mupya. Na vyoha, vihaku na divayi yati visindimala bwina.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msikana mweafwili na mau mmonga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maluko 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Yesu peavi akona angamala kujova malovi ago, chilongosi mmonga Myawudi ambwelili, akamfugamila na kujova, “Msikana wangu afwili hinu. Nambu chondi tihamba ukamvikila mawoko gaku yati itama kangi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesu akayima na kumlanda na vawuliwa vaki vakamlanda.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Mau mmonga, avi na utamu wa kuhuma ngasi lukumbi lwa miyaka kumi na yivili, amlandili Yesu mumbele, na kupamisa lugunyilu lwa nyula yaki. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Akitili chenicho ndava ya aholalili mumtima waki kuvya, “Nakapamisa ndu nyula yaki, yati nilama.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yesu ang'anamwiki na kumlola akamjovela, “Msikana wangu, kangamala mtima kusadika kwaku kukulamisi.” Mau yula akalama lukumbi lulalula.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Yesu ayingili munyumba ya chilongosi yula na peavawene vabeta chitolilo na msambi wa vandu, vivembeneka na kugalawuka, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />avajovili vandu vala “Muwuka pandu apa! Msikana akona mumi, agonili ndu.” Vene vamkamheka. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Hinu msambi wa vandu pavawukili, Yesu akayingila mugati na kumkamula msikana yula chiwoko, na msikana yula akayima. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Malovi ago gadandasiki neju pamulima wula woha.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalamisa ngalola vavili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yesu akawuka pandu penapo, na peavi mukuhamba, vangalola vavili vamlandili na kuywanga, “Mwana wa Daudi utihengela lipyana!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Yesu peayingili munyumba, vangalola vala vamhambili namwene avakotili, “Wu, mwisadika kuvya nihotola kuvalamisa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Vene vakayangula, “Ena, Bambu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Penapo Yesu akavapamisi mumihu gavi na kujova, “Ndi, gavyai mewa kwa nyenye ngati chemwisadika!” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Mihu gavi gadindwiki. Namwene Yesu akavabesa neju, “Mkoto kumjovela mundu yeyoha lijambu lila.”<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Nambu vene vawukili na kugadandaula malovi ga Yesu pamulima wula woha.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mundu ngajova</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Vandu pavawukili, vandu vangi vamletili Yesu mundu mmonga ngajova ndava ya kutalaliwa na mzuka. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Bahapo mzuka wula pawavingiwi, mundu yula akatumbula kujova kavili. Vandu voha vakakangasa na kujova “Lijambu ngati lenili kawaka peliwonekini pa Isilaeli!”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Nambu Vafalisayu vakajova, “Akuyivinga mizuka kwa makakala ga mkulu wa mizuka.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvahengela lipyana vandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu avi mukugenda mumiji na muhijiji yoha, awulayi munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi. Ikokosa Linenu la Bwina la unkosi wa Chapanga, na kuvalamisa matamu gavi na kuvawusila ng'ani zavi. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Hinu, peauwene msambi wa vandu, avahengili lipyana ndava vatotokili neju changali utangatila, ndi vavi na mtahu ngati mambelele gangali mdimaji. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Kangi akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Mabenu gamahele, nambu vabenaji vadebe. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Hinu muyupa mkolo mabenu gaki avatuma vanalihengu vabena mabenu gaki.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Vamitumi kumi na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maluko 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yesu avakemili pamonga vawuliwa vaki kumi na vavili, akavapela uhotola wa kuvinga mizuka na kulamisa utamu ndalindali. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Mahina ga vamitumi vaki kumi na vavili vala ndi aga: Kutumbula Simoni mweikemiwa Petili na Andelea mlongo waki na Yakobo mwana wa Zebedayo, na Yohani mlongo waki, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />vangi ndi Filipi na Batolomei na Tomasi na Matei mtola kodi na Yakobo mwana wa Alufayo na Tadei, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni mweavi mundu wa kukengelela mulima waki na Yuda Isikalioti, mwenuyu ndi mweamng'anamukili Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvatuma vamitumi kumi na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maluko 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesu avatumili kumi na vavili avo na kuvapela uhotola uwu, “Mkoto kuhamba kwa vandu vangali Vayawudi, mewa mkoto kuyingila kumiji ya Vasamaliya. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Nambu mhamba kwa vandu va Isilaeli vevayagili ngati limbelele. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Pemwihamba mvakokosela aga, ‘Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga uvi papipi!’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Mvalamisa vatamu, muvayusa vandu vevafwili, muvanyambisa vevavi na mabudi, mvinga mizuka. Mupatili waka muwusa waka. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Mkoto kugega zahabu amala feza amala shaba mumahaku ginu. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Mewawa mkoto kugega lihaku la lugendu amala magwanda gavili, amala champali amala mkongojo, mhengalihengu iganikiwa kupewa chakulya.”<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Pemwiyingila pamuji wowoha, amala muchijiji chochoha mulonda mundu mweigana kuvapokela kunyumba yaki, ndi mumgendela na mtama kwa mwenuyu mbaka pemwiwuka pandu apo. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Pamuyingila panyumba muvajambusa vakolonjinji. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Ngati vandu va nyumba yeniyo vavapokili nyenye, jambusa yeniyo ya uteke yati yitama bahapo. Nambu ngati vavapokili lepi, jambusa yinu yati yikuvawuyila mwavene. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Ngati vakolo nyumba, vabeli kuvapokela amala kuvayuwanila malovi ginu, hinu pemwiwuka munyumba yeniyo amala muji wenuwo muvakung'undila lububu lwa mumagendelu ginu kulangisa kuvya vene vavabeli nyenye. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Nikuvajovela chakaka, pa ligono la uhamula yati yivya mbanga kwa miji ya Sodoma na Gomola kuliku muji wenuwo.”<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang'ahiso Gegibwela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maluko 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Hinu nene nikuvatuma nyenye ngati limbelele pagati ya libwa la mudahi. Mvya na luhala ngati liyoka na muvya ngolongondi ngati ngunda. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Mujiyangalila na vandu, muni vakuvatakila nyenye mumabanji ga mihalu na valavatova mchapilu munyumba zavi za kukonganekela Vayawudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Yati vakuvapeleka palongolo ya vachilongosi na vankosi ndava ya nene, penapo muhotola kuvajovela vandu malovi gangu na vandu vangali Vayawudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Hinu vakavatakila nyenye mumabanji ga mihalu, mkoto kung'ahika kuholelela tijova kyani, ndava muni yati mwipewa gakujova lukumbi peluhika. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Muni nyenye lepi mwemjova, nambu Mpungu wa Dadi winu yati wijova mugati yinu.”<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Mlongo alamgotola mlongo waki akomiwa na dadi alamgotola mwana waki, mewawa vana yati vakuvang'anamukila vadadi na vanyina vavi na kuvakoma. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Vandu voha vakuvayomela ndava nyenye mukunisadika nene. Nambu mweisindimala mbaka pamwishu yati isanguliwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Vandu vakavavinga kumuji umonga mjumbila pamuji wungi. Nikuvajovela chakaka, mwakona kumala mumiji yoha ya Isilaeli kwakona Mwana wa Mundu kubwela.”<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Muwuliwa akumpita lepi muwula waki, mewawa na mtumisi akumpita lepi mkulu waki. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Yikola muwuliwa kuvya ngati muwula waki, mewawa na mvanda kuvya ngati mkulu waki. Ngati vamkemili mkulu mkolo nyumba Belizebuli, wu, yati vakuvakemela lepi vandu vangi va lukolo lwenulo mahina gahakau neju?”<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yani wa kuyogopewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Hinu mkoto kuvayogopa vandu muni chindu chochoha chechigubikwi yati chigubukuliwa na chindu chochoha chechifiyiki yati chifiyuliwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Genikuvajovela nyenye muchitita, mulijovai mululangasa na lijambu lemwayuwini pachinunu, mulikokosa pavandu. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Mkoto kuvayogopa vala vevikoma higa, nambu nakuhotola kukoma mpungu. Mbanga neju kumuyogopa yula mweihotola kukoma higa pamonga na mpungu mumotu wa magono goha wangajimika. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Mayeluyelu gavili gegiguliswa kwa lishonga limonga lidebe. Nambu hati limonga lihotola lepi kugwa pandima changagana Dadi winu. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Nambu kwa upandi winu, mwene amanyili mvalangu wa mayunju goha ga mitu yinu. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Hinu mkoto kuyogopa, muni nyenye mwitopeswa neju kuliku mayeluyelu gamahele.”<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumyidikila na kumbela Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Kila mundu mweakuniyidakila nene palongolo ya vandu, na nene yati nikumyidakila palongolo ya Dadi wangu mweavi kunani. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Nambu mundu yeyoha mweakunibela nene palongolo ya vandu, na nene yati nikumbelela palongolo ya Dadi wangu mweavi kunani.”<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpechenganu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Mkoto kuhololela ngati nibweli kuleta uteke pamulima. Nibweli lepi kuleta uteke nambu ngondo. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Muni nivaletili mpechenganu pagati yinu, mwana na dadi waki, msikana na nyina waki na mkamwana na nayala waki. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Na vamakoko va mundu, ndi vala va panyumba yaki.”<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Mwene mweakumgana neju dadi amala nyina waki kuliku nene, iganikiwa lepi kuvya muwuliwa wangu. Mewawa mundu yeyoha mweakumgana neju msongolo amala msikana waki kuliku nene, iganikiwa lepi kuvya muwuliwa wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Mundu angagega msalaba waki mwene na kunilanda nene, iganikiwa lepi kuvya wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Mundu mweikamulila wumi waki yati akuuyagisa, nambu mundu mweakuuyagisa wumi waki ndava ya kunisadika nene yati akugapata.”<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupokela njombi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maluko 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Mundu mweavapokela nyenye, akunipokela nene, mundu mweakunipokela nene, akumpokela yula mweanitumili. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Mundu mweakumpokela mlota wa Chapanga, ndava mlota wa Chapanga yati ipokela njombi ya ulota wa Chapanga. Mewawa Mundu mweakumpokela mundu mbwina palongolo ya Chapanga, ndava mundu mbwina yati ipokela njombi ya mundu mbwina. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Nikuvajovela chakaka, mundu yeyoha mweakumpela mmonga pagati ya vandu ava vangamanyikana chikombi cha manji gasisimu ndava mulanda wangu, chakaka ikosa lepi njombi yaki.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Vajumbi kuhuma kwa Yohani Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yesu peamali kuvapela malagizu vawuliwa vaki, kumi na vavili, akawuka penapo, kuhamba kuwula na kukokosa mumiji yeyavi papipi na Galilaya.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Yohani Mbatizaji akungiwi mu jela, peayuwini matendu ga Kilisitu, ndi avatumili vawuliwa vaki, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />vamkota Yesu, “Wu, veve ndi yula mweibwela, amala timlindila yungi?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu akavayangula, “Mhamba, mukamjovela Yohani gala gemukugalola na kuyuwana. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Vangalola vilola na vangagenda vigenda, na vanamabudi vinyambiswa, na vangayuwa viyuwana na vevafwili viyukiswa na vangangu vikokoselewa Linenu la Bwina. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Amotisiwa mundu yula mwangaleka kunisadika!”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Hinu vawuliwa va Yohani vala pavawuyili, Yesu akavajovela msambi wa vandu wewamtindili, malovi ga Yohani, “Mwahambili kulugangatu kulola kiki? Wu mwaganili kulola linyai chelinyuguswa na mpungu? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Hinu mwahambili kulola kyani? Mundu mweawalili nyula za kunyamba? Lola Vandu veviwala nyula za bwina vitama munyumba za vankosi. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Nambu mweambili kulola kyani? Mlota wa Chapanga? Ena, chakaka neju kuliku mlota wa Chapanga.” <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />“Mwenuyu ndi Yohani mweajoviwi mu Mayandiku Gamsopi. ‘Yuwanila nene nikumtuma mjumbi wangu akulongolela, kutendelekela njila yaku.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Nikuvajovela chakaka, pagati ya vandu vevitama pamulima angahumila mweavi mkulu kuliku Yohani Mbatizaji. Pamonga na ago yula mweavi mdebe neju muunkosi wa Chapanga, ndi mkulu kuliku Yohani. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kuhuma lukumbi lwa Yohani Mbatizaji mbaka lelu, Unkosi wa Chapanga ubelelewa neju, na vandu vevavi na makakala vilinga kuutola kwa makakala. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Mawuliwu goha ga vamlota va Chapanga na vawula va Malagizu mbaka lukumbi ulu lwa Yohani galotili mambu ga lusenje lwa hinu.” <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Ngati mwihotola kuyidikila aga, Yohani ndi Eliya mweibwela. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Mweavi na makutu, ndi ayuwana!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Hinu nichiwanangisa na kyani chiveleku ichi? Ngati vasongolo vevitama pandu pa kugulisila vindu na msambi umonga ujovesana na wungi, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Titovii ngo'ma nambu mumbeli kukina! Tiyimbili nyimbu za malilu nambu mvembi lepi!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Ndava muni Yohani abwelili, aleki kulya chakulya ndava ya Bambu, anganywa divayi, vene vakajova, ‘Ana mzuka.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwana wa Mundu abwelili ilya na kunywa vene vakajova, ‘Mumlola mundu uyu! Muhutulu na chigaligali, nkozi wa vatola kodi na vevakumbudila Chapanga!’ Pamonga na genaa luhala lwa Chapanga lumanyikana kuvya labwina ndava ya matendu gaki.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miji yangasadika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Kangi Yesu akatumbula kuhakalila vandu miji yeahengili gachinamtiti gamahele nambu valekili lepi kumbudila Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Mwalachikolela mwavandu va Kolazini! Mwalachikolela mwavandu va Betisaida! Muni, ngati gachinamtiti genihengili kwinu mbanga yagahengiki ku Tilo na ku Sidoni, vandu vaki ngavamali, kuwala magunila na kunyala malyenge vakotwiki kumbudila Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Nambu nikuvajovela mu ligono la uhamula nyenye yati mwihamuliwa neju kuliku vandu va ku Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Na nyenye mwavandu va Kapelanaumu, wu, yati mukujikwiha mbaka kunani kwa Chapanga? Yati wiheleswa mbaka kuligodi litali langali mwishu! Ndava kuvya gachinamtiti gegahengiki kwa veve, yagahengiki ku Sodoma kula, muji wenuwo ngawasigalili mbaka lelu. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Nambu nikuvajovela, ligono la uhamula veve yati wihamuliwa neju kuliku ya vandu va ku Sodoma!”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbwela kwa nene mupumulila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Lukumbi lwenulo, Yesu ajovili, “Nikusengusa, Dadi, Bambu wa kunani na mulima! Ndava uvafiyili mambu genago vevavi na luhala na vasomaji, ndi uvagubukulii vana vadebe.” <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Ena, Dadi, ndi cheyikuganisi.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Dadi wangu anigotolili vindu vyoha. Avi lepi mweamumanyi Mwana nambu Dadi, mewa kawaka mweamumanyi Dadi nambu Mwana, na yeyoha yula ndi Mwana aganili kumgubukulila.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Mbwela mwavoha kwangu, mwemwing'aiswa na kuyegemewa na ndwika na nene yati nikuvapumulisa. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Mjikunga lingolingoli langu, mkajiwula kuhuma kwangu, muni nene ndi nampoli na mngolongondi wa mtima, na nyenye yati mpoleswa mumtima yinu. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Muni, lingolingoli langu litopa lepi ndwika yangu yiyuyuka.”<figure style="fig" file="13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" ref="11:30">Lingolingoli</figure><verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Bambu ndi Ligono la Kupumulila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maluko 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Lukumbi ulo, Yesu avi mukupita mumigunda Ligono la Kupumulila, Hinu, vawuliwa vaki njala yavavinili, vakatumbula kudenya nganu na kuyogola ngele zaki na kulya. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Vafalisayu pevagaweni genago, vakamjovela Yesu, “Lola, vawuliwa vaku vihenga lijambu lelibesiwi kuhenga pa Ligono la Kupumulila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu akayangula, “Wu, mwangasoma cheahengili Daudi na vayaki njala peyamvinili? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Mwene ayingili mu Nyumba ya Chapanga na kulya mabumunda gala gegavikwi palongolo ya Chapanga. Mwene hati vayaki kawaka mweayidakiliwi kulya mabumunda genago. Mabumunda ago gaganikiwi kuliliwa na vamteta va Chapanga ndu. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Amala mwangasoma muchitabu cha Malagizu kuvya kila Ligono la Kupumulila vamteta va Chapanga vakugadenya malagizu ga Musa mu Nyumba ya Chapanga kuni vihololewa lepi kuvya vahokili? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Nambu hinu nikuvajovela kuvya penapa avi mkulu kuliku Nyumba ya Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Kuvya mumanyalila mana ya malovi aga ‘Nigana lipyana, nigani lepi teta zinu.’ Ngamuvahamwili lepi vandu vangahoka. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Muni Mwana wa Mundu ndi Bambu wa Ligono la Kupumulila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu mweavi na chiwoko chechipoli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maluko 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu akawuka penapo, akahamba munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Kwavi na mundu mmonga mweagogodili chiwoko. Hinu, vandu vamkotili Yesu, “Wu, Malagizu giyidakila kumlamisa mundu pa Ligono la Kupumulila?” Vamlingili ndava vapatayi njila ya kumtakila.<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Nambu Yesu akavajovela, “Wu, yani pagati yinu mweavi na limbelele laki, ligwilili muligodi, wu, akulihumisa lepi Ligono la Kupumulila? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Mundu itopeswa neju kuliku limbelele! Hinu ndi yiyidakiliwa kuhenga matendu gabwina pa Ligono la Kupumulila.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Kangi Yesu akamjovela mundu yula, “Talambula chiwoko chaku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">Mwene akachitalambula, ndi chalamili ngati chiwoko chingi chila. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Nambu Vafalisayu vakahuma kuvala na kujovesana, ndava ya mpangu wa kumkoma Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumisi mweahaguliwi na Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Nambu Yesu amanyalili mpangu wula, akawuka pandu pala. Msambi wa vandu wamlandili, akavalamisa vana matamu voha. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Avabesili vakotoka kuvajovela vandu mambu gaki, <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />muni linenu la ajovili Mlota Isaya litimilayi.<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Lola, mtumisi mwenimuhagwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">chiganu changu, mweanihekesa neju mtima wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Nikuuvika mpungu wangu panani yaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">namwene yati ikokosa uhamula wangu kwa milima yoha.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Angahutana, amala kuywanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">mewa lwami lwaki nakuyuwanika munjila<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Mlahi weupondiki akuwudenya lepi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">na utambi wewihuma lyohi wijimika lepi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">mbaka kuhamula kwekuganikiwa kulongosa,<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Vandu voha va milima yoha vakumhuvalila mwene.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Beelizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maluko 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Penapo vandu vamletili Yesu mundu ngalola mewa avi ngajova mweatalaliwi na mzuka. Yesu akamlamisa hati akahotola kujova na kulola. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Msambi woha wa vandu wewavi penapo ukakangasa na kujova, “Wu, mwenuyu lepi mwana wa Daudi?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Nambu Vafalisayu pevayuwini genago, vakajova, “Mundu uyu ivinga mizuka kwa uhotola wa Belizebuli mkulu wa mizuka.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yesu amanyili maholo gavi akajova, “Unkosi wowoha weulekangini chikundi chikundi wewitovana wene, wangahotola kusindimala mewawa na muji amala vandu va nyumba yimonga vevalekangini chikundi chikundi yati vigwa.” <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Ngati Setani akavinga mizuka yaki, akujing'anamukila mwene. Hinu unkosi waki usindimala wuli? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Ngati nyenye mwijova nene nikuyivinga mizuka kwa makakala ga Belizebuli, wu, valanda vinu vivinga kwa makakala ga yani? Ndava ya genago vandu vinu ndi vevakuvahamula nyenye! <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Nambu ngati nivinga mzuka kwa makakala ga Mpungu wa Chapanga, ndi mumanya kuvya Unkosi wa Chapanga umali kuvabwelela.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Ihotola wuli mundu kuizangila nyumba ya mundu mweavi na makakala na kumnyaga vindu vyaki, changali hoti kumkunga mundu ana makakala mwenuyo? Kangi ndi ahotola kumnyaga vindu vyaki.”<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Mundu yeyoha mweanganilanda nene, akunibela, na mundu yeyoha mweangayola pamonga na nene, idandasa. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Ndava yeniyo nikuvajovela, vandu yati vilekekeswa kumbudila kwavi Chapanga na maligu gavi goha, nambu yati ilekekeswa lepi yula mweakumliga Mpungu Msopi. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Kangi, mundu yeyoha mweijova linenu la kumbela Mwana wa Mundu yati ilekekeswa, nambu mundu yeyoha mweijova linenu la kumbela Mpungu Msopi, ilekekeswa lepi pamulima uwu hati pamulima weubwela.”<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkongo na matunda gaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Mkongo wakavya wabwina na matunda gaki yati givya gabwina mewawa, mkongo wakavya uhakau na matunda gaki givya gahakau mewa. Ndi mkongo umanyikana ndava ya matunda gaki. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Nyenye mwachiveleku cha liyoka! Mwihotola wuli kujova mambu gabwina kuni mwavene mwavahakau? Muni mundu ijova gala gegamemili mumtima waki. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Mundu mbwina iwusa mambu gabwina muchibana chaki chabwina, mewawa mundu mhakau iwusa mambu gahakau muchibana chaki chihakau.”<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Hinu nikuvajovela, ligono la uhamula kila mundu yati ihamuliwa kwa kila linenu lihakau leajovili. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Muni malovi gaku wamwene yati wiyidakiliwa umganisi Chapanga, na kwa malovi gaku wamwene yati wihamuliwa kuvya uhokili.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugana ulangisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maluko 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Kangi pagati ya vawula va malagizu na Vafalisayu vamjovili Yesu, “Muwula tigana kulola ulangisu kuhuma kwa veve.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Mwene akayangula, “Chiveleku chihakau changali sadika! Mwigana ulangisu, yati mwipata lepi ulangisu, nambu ndi wulawula wa Yona mweavi mlota wa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Ngati Yona cheatamili magono gadatu kilu na muhi mulutumbu lwa somba yivaha, mewawa Mwana wa Mundu yati itama mugati ya ndima magono gadatu muhi na kilu. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Ligono la uhamula vandu va ku Ninawi yati viyima pamonga na chiveleku ichi na kuchihamula, ndava muni vene vamali kumng'anamukila Chapanga lukumbi Yona peavakokosili. Hinu apa avi mkulu kuliku Yona! <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Nkosi wa chidala wa muji wa Sheba yati ihumila Kwelitipama lilanga lukumbi lwa uhamula wa chiveleku ichi, namwene yati akuchihamula kuvya chihokili. Muni mwene agendili kuhuma kutali, abwelili kuhuma kumulima waki, kuyuwana malovi ga luhala ga Solomoni, kumbi apa avi mkulu kuliku Solomoni.”<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kwa mzuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Mzuka ngati uvingiwi kwa mundu, ulyungalyunga kulugangatu kulonda pandu pa kupumulila. Akupapata lepi pandu, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Kangi akujijovela, ‘Niwuya kavili kunyumba yangu mwenihumili.’ Peiwuya akuyikolela nyumba yila yivii waka yifyagiliwi na kupambwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Kangi ihamba kuyitola mizuka yingi saba, hihakau neju kuliku mwene, yoha ibwela kuyingila kwa mundu yula. Mundu yula ivya mhakau neju kuliku peatumbwili. Hinu ndi yati yivya kwa chiveleku ichi chihakau.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyina na valongo va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maluko 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yesu peavi akona ilongela na vandu, lola, nyina waki na valongo vaki vakahika na kuyima kuvala, vagana kulongela nayu. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Hinu mundu mmonga akamjovela, “Yuwanila nyina waku na valongo vaku vavi kuvala, vigana kulongela na veve.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Nambu Yesu akamyangula mundu yula “Nyina wangu ndi yani? Na valongo vangu ndi vayani?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Kangi akatalambula chiwoko chaki na kuvalangisa vawuliwa vaki, akajova, “Ava ndi nyina wangu na valongo vangu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Muni mundu yeyoha mweihenga geigana Dadi wangu mweavili kunani, mwenuyo ndi mlongo wangu mlumbu wangu na nyina wangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa mmija mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maluko 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Ligono lilolo, Yesu awukili munyumba yila akahamba kutama mumhana ya nyanja. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Msambi uvaha wa vandu wamtindili hati Yesu akakwela muwatu, akatama. Vandu voha vayimili mumhana ya nyanja, <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />namwene Yesu akavajovela mambu ga mahele kwa miluhumu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Myuwanila, mundu mmija mbeyu ahambili kumija mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Peamijili, mbeyu zingi zikagwilila munjila, na hidege yikabwela yikahola. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Zingi zakagwilila pamatalau pangali kuvya na ludaka neju. Zalolikini zimeli kanyata ndava ludaka lwavi lwamahele lepi. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Lilanga palaumili, lachonili ndava mikiga yaki yakamwili lepi muludaka, zikanyala. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Mbeyu zingi zagwilili mumikongo ya minga, ndi mikongo ya minga yikamela na kuzihinya. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Zingi zagwili paludaka lwa bwina, zameli na kupambika, yingi mbeyu miya yimoja na yingi mbeyu sitini na yingi mbeyu selasini.”<verse eid="MAT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Yesu akajova, myuwana nyenye mwemuvi na makutu.<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndava ya miluhumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maluko 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Vawuliwa va Yesu vamhambili, vakamkota, “Ndava kyani wijova na vandu kwa miluhumu?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu akavayangula, “Nyenye mpewili uhotola wa kumanya umfiyu wa Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga, nambu vene vapewili lepi. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Muni mundu mweavi na chindu yati iyonjokesewa neju, nambu mundu angali kuvya na chindu hati cheavi nachu yati chinyagiwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Muni nijova nawu kwa miluhumu, ndava vilolokesa nambu vilola lepi viyuwana nambu vimanya lepi. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Kwa vene gatimili malovi gala geajovili Isaya mweavi mlota wa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">kuyuwana yati mwiyuwana, nambu yati mwimanya lepi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">kulola yati mwilola, nambu yati mwiwona lepi,<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />muni mitima ya vandu ava yitopa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Vagadindii makutu gavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">vagubiki mihu gavi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Kuvya lepi, yavaloli na mihu gavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">yavayuwini na makutu gavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">yavamanyalili muluhala lwavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na kumuwuyila Bambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na nene nganivalamisi.<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Nambu mmotisiwa nyenye, muni mihu ginu gilola na makutu ginu giyuwana. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Nikuvajovela chakaka, vamlota va Chapanga vamahele na vandu va Chapanga vamahele vanogili kugalola gala gemgaloli nambu vagaloli lepi, na kuyuwana gala gemyuwini nambu nakuyuwana.”<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu idandaula luhumu lwa mmija mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maluko 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Hinu, nyenye myuwana ndava ya luhumu lwenulu lwa mmija mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Yeyoha mweiyuwana linenu la Unkosi wa Chapanga changamanya, iwanangana ngati mbeyu zezagwili munjila, ndi yula mhakau ibwela na kutola chechimijiwi mumtima waki. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Mbeyu zezagwili mulitalau ndi luhumu wa mundu yula mweiyuwana linenu lenilo na bahapo akulipokela kwa luheku. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Nambu nakuyingila mugati yaki ndava avi lepi na mikiga, linenu lenilo litama mulukumbi luhupi na pegihumila man'gaiso na kuhengiwa uhakau ndava ya linenu la Chapanga, kanyata igwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Mewawa na mbeyu yeyagwili pagati ya mikongo ya minga, ndi luhumu lwa mundu mweiyuwana linenu lenilo, nambu mambu ga pamulima apa na mnogo wa kugana vindu vyamahele vikulitindila linenu lenilo na ipambika lepi matunda ndi kuhenga gala gakumganisa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Nambu mbeyu yeyagwilili muludaka lwabwina ndi luhumu wa mundu mweiyuwana linenu na kulimanya, ndi yipambika matunda, yimonga matunda miya na yingi matunda sitini na yingi matunda selasini.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa masindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu avajovili vandu luhumu lungi, “Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga uwanangini na mundu mweamijili mbeyu yabwina mumgunda waki. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Hinu vandu pavagonili abwelili mundu likoko na kumija masindi pagati ya nganu na kuwuka. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Penapo nganu peyameli na kutumbula kuholomola njechela, mewawa masindi gakahumila. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Vatumisi va mkolo mgunda vamhambili na kumjovela mwene, ‘Bambu, chakaka wamijili mbeyu zabwina kumgunda waku. Hinu masindi gahumili koki?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Mwene akavayangula, ‘Mundu likoko ndi mweahengili genago.’ Ndi vatumisi vaki vakamkota wigana tete tikatupulai masindi? <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Mwene akavayangula, ‘Lepi,’ Pangi pemwitupula masindi, yati mwitupula na nganu mewa. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Mlekayi vikula pamonga mbaka lukumbi lwa kubena. Lukumbi lwenulo ndi yati nikuvajovela vabenaji, vayola hoti masindi na kugakunga malundu ga kuyocha motu, na nganu mbenai na kuyivika pachibana changu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa mbeyu ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maluko 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesu avajovili vandu luhumu lungi, “Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga uwanangini na mbeyu yidebe yeyikemiwa haladali mundu ayitolili, na kumija kumgunda waki. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Yene yivya yidebe kuliku mbeyu zoha, nambu yikamela na yikula kuvya mkongo uvaha kuliku mimea yoha, hati hidege yibwela na kujenga hisakanilu, mumambanda gaki.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa ngemeku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu avajovili luhumu lungi, “Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga uwanangini na mau mmonga mweagegili ngemeku, akahangisana na uhembe madebe gavili na lapinga, na uhembe woha watutumwiki.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengu ga miluhumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Maluko 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu aujovili msambi wa vandu genago goha kwa miluhumu, kawaka chindu cheajovili changali miluhumu, <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Muni lijambu leajovili mlota wa Chapanga litimilayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Yati nijova nawu kwa luhumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">yati nikuvajovela mambu gegafiyiki kutumbula kuwumbwa kwa mulima.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu idandaula luhumu lwa masindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Kangi Yesu avalagili vandu vala, akayingila munyumba. Vawuliwa vaki vamhambalili vakamjovela, “Utidandaulila luhumu lwa masindi kumgunda.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yesu akavayangula, “Mmija mbeyu zabwina ndi Mwana wa Mundu <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Mgunda wula ndi pamulima. Mbeyu zabwina zila ndi vandu vala unkosi ndi wavi. Nambu masindi gala ndi vandu va yula Mhakau. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Mundu likoko yula mweamijili masindi ndi Setani. Mabenu ndi mwishu wa mulima uwu, vabenaji ndi Vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Ngati chavitupula masindi na kugayocha motu, ndi yati cheyivya pamwishu wa mulima uwu. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana wa Mundu yati akuvatuma Vamitumu vaki va Chapanga vavayola kuhuma ku Unkosi waki voha vevibudisa vandu kwa Chapanga na vevavi na matendu gahakau, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />na kuvataga mulitanulu la motu ukali kwenuko yati vivemba na kuyaga minu. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Kangi, vandu vevihenga matendu gabwina palongolo ya Chapanga yati ving'asima ngati lilanga muunkosi wa Dadi wavi. Hinu mweavi na makutu ndi ayuwana!”<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa vindu vya mashonga gamahele vyevifiyiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga uwanangana ngati vindu vya mashonga gamahele vyevifiyiki kumgunda. Mundu mmonga ayiwene, akafiya kavili. Ahekili neju, hati akahamba kugulisa vyoha vyeavi navyu na akagula mgunda wula.”<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa lulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Kavili Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga uwanangana na mgulisa vindu mweilonda chindu cha mashonga gamahele neju chechikemelewa lulu. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Peapatili lulu yimonga yeyiguliswa kwa mashonga gamahele neju, akahamba, kugulisa vyoha vyeavi navyu na kugula chindu chila.”<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa ngwanda wa somba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Mewawa Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga uwanangana na ngwanda wa somba weujwigiwi munyanja, kulova somba ndalindali. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Paumemili, valova somba vahutili pandumba, vakatama na kuhagula somba zabwina na kuvika mumadengu gavi, na somba zezawolili vakataga. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Chenichi ndi cheyivya pamwishu wa mulima uwu, Vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga yati vihumila na kupangula vandu vabwina na vandu vahakau, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />kangi yati vakuvataga vandu vahakau mulitanulu la motu, kwenuko ndi yati vivemba na kuyaga minu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vindu vya mupya na vya kadeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu akavakota, “Wu, mukugamanya mambu goha aga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Vakamyangula, “Ena.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Mwene akavajovela, “Hinu ndi kila muwula wa malagizu mweajiwulili kuuvala unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga, iwanangana ngati mkolo nyumba mweiwusa vindu muchibana vya mashonga gamahele vyamupya na vyakadeni.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vakumbela ku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maluko 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesu peamali kujova miluhumu yeniyo awukili pandu pala, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />akahamba kumuji wavi. Akatumbula kuwula vandu munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi, vevamyuwini vakakangasa, vakajova, “Mwenuyu apatili koki luhala ulu?” Na uhotola wa kuhenga gachinamtiti? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Wu, mwenuyu lepi mwana wa yula mhongola mikongo? Na nyina waki ikemiwa lepi Maliya na valongo vaki, lepi Yakobo na Yosefu na Simoni na Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Valumbu vaki voha nakutama pamonga na tete? Hinu agapatili koki mambu ago goha?<verse eid="MAT 13:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Vabeli kumpokela, nambu Yesu akavajovela, “Mlota wa Chapanga itopeswa kila pandu, nambu nakutopeswa pamuji wa kunyumba yaki mwene!” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Hinu ndava ya kubela kumsadika kwavi, Yesu nakuhenga gachinamtiti yamahele kula.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Kufwa kwa Yohani Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maluko 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Lukumbi lwenulo, chilongosi Helodi ayuwini malovi ga Yesu <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Kangi, akavajovela vatumisi vaki, “Mundu mwenuyo ndi Yohani Mbatizaji, ayukili ndi muni makakala gachinamtiti gihenga lihengu mugati yaki.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Muni Helodi ndi mweamkamwili Yohani akamkunga pingu na kumsopa muchifungu, ndava ya Helodiya, mdala wa Filipi, mlongo waki. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Ndava Yohani amjovili Helodi, “Chabwina lepi veve kumgega Helodiya mdala wa mlongo waku!” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Helodi aganili kumkoma Yohani, nambu ayogwipi vandu ndava vandu vammanyili Yohani avi Mlota wa Chapanga.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Hinu paligono la mselebuko wa kuvelekewa Helodi, msikana wa Helodiya akinili palongolo ya vayehe na Helodi ahekili neju. <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />Namwene akamjovela kwa chilapu kumpela msikana mwenuyo chindu chochoha cheiyupa.<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Mwene kuni ikohakewa na nyina waki ndi akayupa, “Unipela mutu wa Yohani Mbatizaji mulupalu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Nkosi akavya ngolongondi, nambu ndava ya chilapu chaki, na vayehe vala veavagongolili pachakulya, alagizi vampelai. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Hinu, Helodi atumili mundu muchifungu amdumula Yohani mutu. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Vakavika mutu wa Yohani muchipalu na kumpela msikana yula, namwene akampelekela nyina waki. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Vawuliwa va Yohani, vakabwela vakatola higa yaki na kuzika. Kangi vakahamba kumjovela Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvapela chakulya msambi uvaha wa vandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohani 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Peamali kuyuwana ago, Yesu akawuka pandu apo na watu, na kuhamba pandu pachiepela, ngamwene. Nambu vandu vakayuwana ndi vakamlanda na magendelu kuhuma kumiji. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Yesu peahulwiki kubwani, auwene msambi wa vandu, akavahengela lipyana, akavalamisa vatamu voha.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Payavi kimihi, vawuliwa vaki vakamhambila vakamjovela Yesu, “Pandu apa ndi palugangatu, na lilanga limali kutipama. Hinu uvalaga vandu vahamba muvijiji vakajigulila vyakulya.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Nambu Yesu akavayangula “Viganikiwa lepi kuhamba, mvapela nyenye chakulya.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Nambu vene vakajova, “Tivii na mabumunda mhanu na somba zivili ndu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu akavajovela, “Muniletelai apa.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Ndi akavajovela vandu vatama mumanyai, na Yesu akatola mabumunda gala mhanu na somba zila zivili, akalolokesa kunani kwa Chapanga, akamsengusa Chapanga. Kangi akagametula mabumunda gala, na kuvapela vawuliwa vaki, navene vakavapela vandu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Vandu voha vakalya na kuyukuta. Na vawuliwa vaki vakanonga hipandi yeyisigalili, na kumemesa madengu kumi na gavili. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Mvalangu wa vandu voha vevalili vavi vagosi elufu mhanu, changavalanga vadala na vana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu igenda panani ya manji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maluko 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohani 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Bahapo Yesu akavalagiza vawuliwa vaki vayingila muwatu, vamlongolela kumwambu ya nyanja lukumbi mwene ilagana na msambi wa vandu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Peamali kuvalaga vandu, akakwela kuchitumbi nga mwene kumuyupa Chapanga. Kimihi payahikili Yesu avi mwene ndu penapo, <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />nambu watu wula wamali kuhika pagati ya nyanja, nambu yikakang'wa neju na mtimbunganu wa manji, muni chimbungululu wakang'wayi wiwuya mumbele.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Hamba kucha payahegalili, Yesu avahambili vawuliwa vaki igenda kwa magendelu panani ya manji. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Nambu vawuliwa vaki pavamuwene igenda panani ya manji vakavagaya neju, vakajova “Lihoka!” Vakaywanga cha wogohi.<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Bahapo Yesu akalongela nawu, “Mguna, ndi nene mkoto kuyogopa!”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Petili akajova, “Bambu ngati chakaka ndi wamwene, nijovela nibwela kwaku nigenda panani ya manji.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu akamyangula, “Ena, bwela.” Hinu ndi Petili akahuluka muwatu wula akagenda panani ya manji, akamhambila Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Nambu peuweni mpungu wula, akayogopa, akatumbula kujwigama akavemba kwa lwami, “Bambu unisangulayi!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Penapo, ndi Yesu akatalambula chiwoko chaki na akamkamula akamjovela, “Veve mweusadika padebe! Ndava kyani uvi na mtahu?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Ndi akayingila muwatu, na mpungu ukaguna. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Voha vevavi muwatu vamfugamili, vakajova, “Chakaka veve ndi Mwana wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalamisa vatamu va ku Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maluko 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Vakakupuka nyanja vakahika mulima wa ku Genezaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Vandu pevammanyili Yesu, vakadandasa malovi pandu pala poha. Kangi vakamletela vatamu voha, <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />vakamuyupa neju avayidakila vapamisa ndu lugunyilu lwa nyula yaki. Na voha vevapamisi valamili.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu ga vagogo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maluko 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Vafalisayu vangi na vawula va malagizu vakahika kuhuma ku Yelusalemu, vakamhambila Yesu vakamkota, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Ndava kyani vawuliwa vaku vitopesa lepi mawuliwu ga vagogo vitu? Visamba lepi chabwina mawoko kwakona kulya chakulya!”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu akayangula, “Ndava kyani nyenye mwidenya mihilu ya Chapanga, ndava ya kulanda mawuliwu ginu?” <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Chapanga amali kujova, uvatopesa dadi waku na nyina waku, na mweampela likoto dadi waki amala nyina waki yikumgana akomiwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Nambu nyenye mwijova, mundu mweakumjovela dadi waki amala nyina waki kuvya, chochoha chenihotola kukutangatila, nimuwusili Chapanga, <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />iganikiwa lepi kumtangatila dadi waki amala nyina waki. Chenichi ndi chemdenya amuli ya Chapanga kwa kugalanda mawuliwu ginu! <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />“Nyenye mwemkujikita kuvya vandu vabwina! Isaya alotili chakaka, ndava yinu, peajovili malovi aga!<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Chapanga ijova, vandu ava vakunitopesa kwa malovi ndu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">nambu mitima yavi yivii kutali na nene.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Kunigundamila kwavi ndi waka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">ndava mambu geviwula ndi malagizu ga vandu ndu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vindu vyevikumkita mundu uhakau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maluko 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Kangi Yesu aukemili msambi wa vandu akaujovela, “Myuwanila na kumanya malovi genikuvajovela! <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Chindu chechikumyingisa mundu uhakasa palongolo ya Chapanga lepi chechiyingila mumlomo, nambu ndi chila chechikumuhuma mundu mumlomo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Kangi vawuliwa vaki vakamhambila, vakamjovela, “Wu, umanyili kuvya Vafalisayu vayomili pevayuwini malovi gaku?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Nambu mwene akavayangula, “Mbeyu yeyoha angamija Dadi wangu mweavi kunani, yati yitupuliwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Mvaleka vene! Vene ndi vangalola, vachilongosi wa vangalola, na ngalola akamlongosa ngalola muyaki, voha vavili yati vidumbukila muligodi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Petili akajova, “Utidandaulila luhumu wenuwo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu akajova, “Hati nyenye mwakona mwangagamanya ago? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Wu, mwihotola lepi kumanya chechiyingila mumlomo chihamba mulutumbu na chihumiswa kuvala kundindima? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Nambu mambu gegihumila mumlomo gihuma mumtima, genago ndi gegakumkita mundu akotoka kuyidakiliwa palongolo ya Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Ndi mumtima gihuma maholo na ukomaji na ugoni na ukemi na kuyiva na malovi ga udesi na maligu. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Genago ndi gegakumkita mundu kuvya mhakasa palongolo ya Chapanga. Nambu kulya chakulya changasamba nakumuyingisa mundu uhakasa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadika ya mau mmonga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maluko 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yesu awukili pandu penapo akahamba kutama kumuji wa Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Mau mmonga Mkanani wa mulima wenuwo ambwelili na kuywanga neju, “Bambu Mwana wa Daudi, unihengela lipyana! Msikana wangu ing'ahiswa na mzuka.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Nambu Yesu ayangwili lepi, hinu vawuliwa vaki vakamhambila, vakamjovela, “Mjovela awuka lola akutilanda kuni iywanga.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yesu akayangula, “Nitumwili ndu kwa mulima wa Isilaeli, vevavi ngati limbelele leliyagili.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Nambu mau yula akabwela akamfugamila, akajova “Bambu, unitangatila.”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu akamyangula “Chabwina lepi kutola chakulya cha vana na kutagila mabwa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Hinu mau yula akayangula, “Chakaka, Bambu, nambu hati mabwa gilya masigalilu gegigwa pahi pameza ya bambu wavi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Penapo ndi Yesu akayangula, “Mau veve, sadika yaku yivaha! Uhengewa ngati chaugana.” Msikana waki akalama lukumbi lulalula.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalamisa vandu vamahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu akawuka penapo akahamba mumhana wa nyanja Galilaya, akakwela pachitumbi, akatama pahi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Msambi wa vandu vambwelili vamletili vevagogodili higa na vangalola na vangajova pamonga na vangi vamahele vevagogodili magendelu vana matamu, vakavavika palongolo ya magendelu gaki, mwene akavalamisa <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Msambi wa vandu ukakangasa neju pavaweni vangajova vijova, vevagogodili higa vilama vevagogodili magendelu vigenda na vangalola vilola, vandu vakamulumba Chapanga wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuupela msambi wa vandu chakulya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maluko 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yesu avakemili vawuliwa vaki na kuvajovela, “Nikuvahengela lipyana vandu ava ndava vatamii pamonga na nene magono gadatu, nivii lepi na chindu chakulya. Nangagana vawuka na njala, muni vakotoka kuinduka munjila.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Vawuliwa vaki vakamjovela, “Penapa palukongolo tipata koki chakulya cha kuyukuta msambi woha wa vandu?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu akavakota, “Mabumunda gavi galinga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Vakamyangula “Saba na tusomba tudebe.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Yesu akalagiza vandu vatama pahi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Akatola mabumunda gala saba na tusomba tudebe tula, akalolokesa kunani kwa Chapanga, akamsengusa Chapanga, akavimetula, akavapela vawuliwa vaki, navene vakavagavila vandu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Voha vakalya na kuyukuta. Kangi vakayola masigalilu ga hipandi na kumemesa madengu saba. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Vandu vevalili vavi vagosi elufu mcheche changavalanga vadala na vana.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Ndi Yesu akavalaga vandu vala, akayingila muwatu, akahamba kumuji wa Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Vandu vigana Gachinamtiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maluko 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Vafalisayu na Vasadukayu vamhambili Yesu na kumlinga, vamyupili avalangisa ulangisu kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Nambu Yesu akavayangula, “Yikahika kimihi mwijova yati kwivya kwabwina ndava kunani kudung'u! <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Na lukela hamba kucha mwijova, ‘Lelu yati kwivya na fula, ndava kunani kudung'u na mahundi gatindili!’ Mwimanya bwina kusoma ulangisu wa kunani, nambu mwangamanya kusoma ulangisu wa lusenje lwa hinu.<verse eid="MAT 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Chiveleku changasadika! Chigana ulangisu, chipewa lepi ulangisu, nambu nga wulawula wa Yona mweavi mlota wa Chapanga.” Yesu akavaleka, akawuka.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngemeku ya Vafalisayu na Vasadukayu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maluko 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Vawuliwa vaki pavamali kukupuka kumwambu ya nyanja vakumbwiki kuvya vakosiwi kugega mabumunda. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yesu akavajovela, “Mvya mihu na mujiyangalila na ngemeku ya Vafalisayu na Vasadukayu!”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Nambu vene vakajovesana, “Ijova genaga ndava tigegili lepi mabumunda.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesu amanyili maholo gavi, akavajovela, “Nyenye vandu mwemsadika padebe, ndava kyani mwijovesana ndava nakuvya na mabumunda? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Mwangamanya? Mwikumbuka lepi mabumunda gala mhanu genavalisili vandu vala elufu mhanu ndi madengu galinga gemwamemisi? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Amala, mabumunda saba gala genavalisili vandu elufu mcheche, wu, madengu galinga ga masigalilu gemwamemisi? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Ndava kyani nakumanya, kuvya navi nakulongalela mambu ga mabumunda? Nambu mjiyangalila na ngemeku ya Vafalisayu na Vasadukayu!”<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Kangi vawuliwa vakamanya kuvya avi nakujova ndava ya ngemeku ya mabumunda, nambu ndava ya mawuliwu ga Vafalisayu na Vasadukayu.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi Mwana wa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maluko 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu peahikili muji wa Kaisalia Filipi, akavakota vawuliwa vaki, “Vandu vijova Mwana wa Mundu ndi nayani?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Vakamyangula, “Vangi vijova Yohani Mbatizaji,” “Vangi vijova Eliya na vangi vijova Yelemia, amala mmonga pagati ya Vamlota va Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yesu akavakota, “Na nyenye mwijova nene ndi yani?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Petili akayangula, “Veve ndi Kilisitu, Mwana wa Chapanga mweavi mumi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu akajova, “Umotisiwa veve Simoni mwana wa Yona, ndava muni, kawaka mundu yeyoha mweakugubukuli lijambu lenili, nambu Dadi wangu wa kunani. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Nene nikuvajovela, veve ndi Petili, na panani ya litalau lenili yati nijenga msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu. Hati makakala ga lifwa gihotola lepi. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Yati nikupela fungulu za Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga, chochoha cheudinda pamulima yati chidindiwa kunani kwa Chapanga, mewawa chochoha cheudindula pamulima, yati chidinduliwa kunani kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Kangi Yesu avabesili neju vawuliwa vaki vakotoka kumjovela mundu yeyoha yula kuvya mwene ndi Kilisitu Msangula.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ijova ndava ya kung'aiswa na kufwa kwaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maluko 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Kuhumila penapo Yesu atumbwili kuvajovela hotohoto vawuliwa vaki, kuvya yikumgana ahamba ku Yelusalemu, na kwenuko yati inga'iswa pamahele, ndava ya kuyokiswa na vagogo, na vamteta vakulu na vawula va malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa, kuvya yati ikomiwa na paligono la datu yati iyuka.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Petili akamtola pamhana, akatumbula kumhakalila, “Gakotoka kukuhumila Bambu! Lijambu lenilo langakukolela!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Nambu Yesu akang'anamuka, akamjovela Petili, “Wuka palongolo yangu, Setani! Veve ndi Chipingilu changu, maholo gaku lepi ga Chapanga nambu gachimundu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Kangi Yesu akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Mundu yeyoha mweigana kuvya mlanda wangu yikumgana ajibela mwene, atola msalaba waki, anilandayi. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Muni, mundu mweigana kuusangula wumi waki mwene, yati akuuyagisa, nambu mundu mweakuuyagisa wumi waki ndava yangu yati akuupata kavili. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Wu, mundu yati ipata kyani akapata vindu vyoha vya pamulima na kuuyagisa wumi waki? Amala mundu yati iwusa chindu kiki chivya pandu pa wumi waki? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Ndava muni, Mwana wa Mundu yati ibwela na ukulu wa Dadi waki pamonga na vamitumu vaki va kunani kwa Chapanga, penapo ndi peakumuwuyisila kila mundu ndava ya matendu gaki. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Nikujovela chakaka, vavi vangi bahapa, vifwa lepi changamlola Mwana wa Mundu ibwela avi Nkosi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Pamihu pa Yesu ping'anamuka chingi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maluko 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Pegamaliki magono sita, Yesu avatoli Petili na Yakobo na Yohani mlongo waki, akahamba nawu ngavene kunani ya chitumbi chitali. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Kwenuko, Yesu ang'anamwiki mlolekanu waki palongolo yavi. Pamihu paki pang'asimi ngati lilanga na nyula zaki zang'asimi ngati lumuli. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Kangi vawuliwa vadatu vala vavawene Musa na Eliya vilongela na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Penapo petili akamjovela Yesu, “Bambu ndi chabwina tete kuvya apa! Ngati wigana yati nijenga vindanda vidatu chimonga cha veve, chimonga cha Musa na chingi cha Eliya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Petili peavi akona ijova ago, lihundi la msopi lavagubiki, na lwami lukayuwanika kuhuma mulihundi, “Mwenuyu ndi mwana vangu mwenikumgana mweniganisiwa nayu mumyuwanilayi.”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Vawuliwa vala pevayuwini genago, vakayogopa neju, vakagwa chakukupama. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Nambu Yesu akavahambila, akavapamisa, akajova, “Myima mkoto kuyogopa!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Pavayinula mitu yavi na kulola avi lepi mundu yungi, nambu ndi Yesu mwene.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Hinu, pavahelela kuhuma kuchitumbi, ndi Yesu avabesili, “Mkoto kumjovela mundu mambu gemgaweni mbaka Mwana wa Mundu peiyukiswa.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Kangi vawuliwa vakamkota “Ndava kyani vawula va malagizu vijova Eliya abwela hoti?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu akavayangula, “Chakaka, Eliya yati ibwela hoti na kutendelekela mambu goha. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Nambu nikuvajovela, Eliya amali kubwela na vene nakummanya, nambu vamhengili chavaganili. Mewawa Mwana wa Mundu yati in'gahiswa mumawoko gavi.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Kangi vawuliwa vamanyili kuvya akuvajovela kumvala Yohani Mbatizaji.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa msongolo anamizuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maluko 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Pevauhikili kavili msambi wa vandu, mundu mmonga amhambili Yesu, akamfugamila palongolo yaki, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />akajova “Bambu mhengela lipyana mwana vangu muni ihinduka, kangi ing'ahika neju, pamahele mwene igwa pamotu amala mumanji. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Namletili kwa vawuliwa vaku nambu vahotwili lepi kumlamisa.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu akayangula, “Nyenye chiveleku changasadika na chechiyagili yati nitama na nyenye mbaka ndali? Yati nikuvasindimalila nyenye mbaka ndali? Mniletela apa mwana mwenuyo.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yesu akahakalila mzuka wula, wene ukamuwuka ndi msongolo yula akalama lukumbi lulalula.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Kangi vawuliwa vakamhambila Yesu pachiepela na kumkota, “Ndava kyani tete tahotwili lepi kuuwusa mzuka?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu akayangula, “Ndava sadika yinu yidebe. Nikuvajovela chakaka ngati muvi na sadika hati yidebe ngati mbeyu ya haladali. Mwihotola kuchijovela chitumbi ichi, ‘Wuka apa uhamba pala!’ Nachene yati chihamba, kawaka chindu chochoha changahengeka kwinu.” <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Nambu mzuka ngati uwu nakuhuma, nambu kwa kumuyupa Chapanga na kujihinisa kulya chakulya.<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilongela kavili ndava ya lifwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maluko 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Vawuliwa va Yesu pevavi pamonga ku Galilaya Yesu akavajovela, “Mwana wa Mundu yati igotolewa kwa vandu. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Yati vakumkoma nambu paligono la datu yati iyukiswa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">Vawuliwa vaki vakavya vakaviniswa mtima.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulipa kodi ya Nyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Pevahikili ku Kapelanaumu vandu vevitola kodi ya Nyumba ya Chapanga vakamhambila Petili, vakamkota, “Wu, muwula winu, ilipa kodi ya Nyumba ya Chapanga?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Petili akavayangula, “Ena, ilipa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Hinu, petili peayingili munyumba kwakona angajova chindu, Yesu akamkota, “Simoni, veve wihololela wuli? Vankosi va pamulima vitola ushulu amala kodi kuhuma kwa yani? Kuhuma kwa vakolonjinji amala kwa vayehe?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Petili akayangula “Kwa vayehe.” Yesu akamjovela chakaka, “Vakolonjinji vilipa lepi. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Nambu tikotoka kuvayomesa vandu ava. Uhamba kunyanja ukataga luvecha, somba yeutumbwili kulova utola, udindula mlomo waki yati ukolela lishonga utola ulipa kodi ndava yaku na ndava yangu.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Yani ndi mvaha neju?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maluko 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Lukumbi lwenulo vawuliwa vamhambili Yesu, vakamkota, “Yani mweavimvaha Muunkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yesu amkemili mwana mmonga na akamyimika pagati yavi, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />Kangi akajova, “Nikuvajovela chakaka, ngati mwing'anamuka lepi na kuvya ngati vana vadebe, katu nakuyingila muunkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Mundu yeyoha mweakujihelesa pahi ngati mwana, mwenuyo ndi mvaha munkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Mundu yeyoha mweakumpokela mwana mmonga ngati uyu paliina langu, akunipokela nene.”<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malingiwu ga kuhenga gahakau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maluko 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Mundu yeyoha mweakumbudisa mmonga pagati ya vadebe vevisadika vabudayi, ngayivii mbanga akungiwa liganga livaha la kuyagila muhingu na kujwigiswa pagati ya nyanja yivaha.<figure style="fig" file="01 Millstone.jpg" size="col" ref="18:6">Vandu vavili viyaga kwa liganga</figure> <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Valachikolela vandu va mulima ndava ya kuyokisa vangi vagwai. Mabudisa genago yikugagana gahumila, nambu alachikolela mundu yula mweakugabudisa.”<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Ngati chiwoko chaku amala chigendelu chaku chikubudisa, chidumulai na kutaga kutali, Mbanga veve kuyingila kuwumi changali chiwoko chimonga amala chigendelu chimonga kuliku veve kuyingila kumotu wa magono goha wangajimika kuni uvi na mawoko gavili amala magendelu gavili. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Lihu laku lakakubudisa, ulitupula na ulitaga kutali. Mbanga veve kuyingila muwumi wa magono goha gangali mwishu kuni uvi na lihu limonga kuliku kuvya na mihu gavili na kutagwa kumotu wa magono goha wangali mwishu wangajimika kuni uvi na mihu gaku gavili.”<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa limbelele leliyagili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Mjiyangalila mkoto kuvavevesa mmonga wa vadebe ava. Nikuvajovela vamitumu vavi kunani kwa Chapanga magono goha vavi palongolo ya Dadi wangu. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Ndava muni Mwana wa Mundu abwelili kusangula chechiyagili.”<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Mwihololela wuli? Ngati mundu avi na mambelele miya yimonga, limbele limonga lakayagai. Wu, nakugaleka mambelele tisini na tisa pachitumbi, kuhamba kulonda limonga lelikayagili? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Ngati aliwene, nikuvajovela chakaka yati akulihekelela neju lenilo kuliku gala tisini na tisa gangayaga. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Mewawa, Dadi winu mweavi kunani, nakugana mmonga wa vadebe ava ayaga.”<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlongo akakuhokela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Mlongo waku akakuhokela umhambila ukamlangisa cheakuhokili muvi mwavene. Akakuyuwana ndi umpati kavili mlongo waku. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Ngati nakukuyuwanila, hamba na mundu yungi mmonga amala vavili muni kwa malovi ga vandu vavili amala vadatu lijambu loloha limaliswa ngati Mayandiku Gamsopi chegijova. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Ngati akabela kuvayuwana venavo, uwujovela msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu, ngati akuvayuwanila lepi avo, kwa veve ndi avya ngati vandu vangammanya Chapanga na vevitola kodi.”<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubesa na kulekekesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Nikujovela chakaka, chemwibesa pamulima, yati chibesewa kunani kwa Chapanga, mewawa chechiyidakiliwa pamulima yati chiyidakiliwa kunani kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />Nijova kangi, vavili pagati yinu vakayidakilana pamulima ndava ya lijambu loloha la kumuyupa Chapanga, Dadi wangu wa kunani yati akuvahengela lijambu lenilo. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Ndava muni popoha pamuvi vavili amala vadatu kwa liina langu, nene nivii penapo pagati yavi.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa mtumisi angalekekesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Kangi Petili akamhambila Yesu, akamkota “Bambu, wu, mlongo wangu akanibudilayi, nimulekekesa mala yilinga? Amala mala saba?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu akayangula, “Nijova lepi nga mala saba, nambu sabini mala saba.” <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Ndava yeniyi ndi Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga uwanangana na mkulu mmonga mweaganili kuhenga mvalangu wa madeni na vatumisi vaki. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Peatumbwili kuvalanga, vamletili mundu mweadaiwayi mashonga elufu kumi. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Mundu mwenuyo avi lepi na chindu cha kulipa, mkulu waki akahamula, aguliswai ngati mvanda mwene na mdala waki na vana vaki na vindu vyeavili navyu muni valipa lideni. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Hinu, mtumisi yula. Akagwa pahi, akafugama, akajova, unilindila nene yati nikukulipa lideni loha! <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Mkulu yula akamhengela lipyana akamlekekesa lideni lila akamleka ahamba.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Nambu mundu yula pawukili, akakonganeka na mtumisi muyaki mweamdayayi mashonga gadebe. Akamkamula akamdodoyola hingu, akumjovela ‘Nilipa lideni laku!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Mtumisi muyaki akafugama, akajova, niyupa, ‘Unilindila nene yati nikukulipa lideni laku loha!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Nambu mwene angayidakila, ndi akamusopa muchifungu mbaka peilipa lideni lila. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Hinu, vatumisi vayaki pavawene lijambu lelahumalili vakaviniswa mtima, vakahamba kumjovela mkulu wavi kulivala lijambu lelahengiki. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Kangi mkulu yula akamkemela mtumisi mwenuyo, akamjovela, ‘Veve ndi mtumisi mhakau neju! Nikulekekisi lideni laku loha pewaniyupili. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Wu, yakuganili lepi veve kumlekekesa mtumisi muyaku ngati chenikulekekisi nene?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Hinu mkulu yula akamema ligoga, akamgotola kwa vang'aisa muchifungu mbaka peilipa lideni laki loha.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />“Na dadi wangu mweavi kunani yati akuvahengela mewawa ngati kila mmonga winu akumlekekesa lepi mlongo waki kwa mtima waki woha.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu gakubesa kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maluko 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu peamali kujova malovi ago, akawuka kumkoa wa ku Galilaya na kuhamba kumuji wa Yudea kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Msambi uvaha wa vandu wamlandili kwenuko, mwene akavalamisa.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Hinu pagati ya Vafalisayu vangi vakambwelela vakamulinga kumkota, “Wuli, ndi chabwina mgosi kumleka mdala waki ndava ya chindu chochoha chila?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu akavayangula, “Wu, mwangasoma mu Mayandiku Gamsopi kuvya Chapanga mweawumbili mundu kutumbula kadeni, amuwumbili mundu mgosi na mdala? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Kangi akajova, ‘Ndava yeniyo, mgosi yati akumleka dadi waki na nyina waki na kuwungana na mdala waki, ndi voha vavili yati vivya higa yimonga.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Ndava yeniyo, ndi lepi kavili vavili, nambu higa yimonga. Cheachiwunganishi Chapanga mundu akoto kuchipangulana.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Nambu Vafalisayu vakamkota, “Ndava kyani, Musa atilagazili yihotoleka mgosi kumpela mdala waki balua na kumleka?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu akayangula, “Musa avalekekisi ndava ya kutopa kwa mitima yinu. Nambu nakuvya chenicho kutumbula Chapanga peawumbili mulima. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Nikuvajovela, mundu yeyoha mweakumleka mdala waki na kugega mdala yungi ikita ugoni nambu ndu ndava ya ukemi ihotola kumleka.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Vawuliwa vaki vakamjovela, “Ngati mambu ga mgosi na mdala waki ndi ago, mbanga kukotoka kugega.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu akavajovela, “Lepi voha vevihotola kuyidakila linenu lenili, nambu vala vevahotwisi na Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Muni gavi mambu ndalindali gegihenga vagosi vakotoka kugega, vavi vevavelikiwi kahumbi kapecha, vangi ndava vahengiwi na vandu kuvya vakahumbi kapecha na vangi vigega lepi ndava ya Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga. Mweihotola kuyidakila linenu lenilo ayidakilayi.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvamotisa vana vadebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maluko 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Kangi vandu vamletili Yesu vana vadebe muni avavikila mawoko na kuvayupila. Nambu vawuliwa vaki vakavahakalila vandu vala. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Nambu Yesu akavajovela, “Muvaleka vana ava vabwela kwa nene, na mkoto kuvabesa, muni Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga ndi wa vandu ngati vana venava.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Hinu Yesu peamali kuvavikila mawoko muni avamotisa, ndi akawuka pandu penapo.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msongolo mweavi na vindu vyamahele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maluko 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Mundu mmonga amhambili Yesu akamkota, “Muwula, nikita chindu kiki chabwina nivyaa na wumi wa magono goha?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu akamyangula, “Ndava kyani ukunikota lijambu la bwina? Avi mmonga ndu mweavi mbwina. Ngati wigana kuvya na wumi wa magono goha, uyidakila mihilu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Mundu yula akamkota, “Mihilu yoki?” Yesu akamyangula, “Ukoto kukoma, kukita ugoni, kuyiva, kujova udesi, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />vatopesayi dadi waku na nyina waku na umgana muyaku ngati cheukujigana wamwene.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Msongolo yula akamjovela, “Genago goha nigalandili, hinu nihenga kyani neju?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu akamjovela, “Ngati wigana kuvya chakaka mundu mbwina, uhamba ukagulisa vindu vyaku vyoha. Mashonga ago goha uvapela vangangu na veve yati ukujivikila vindu vyamahele kunani kwa Chapanga, kangi ubwela unilandayi.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Hinu msongolo yula peayuwini malovi gala, akahamba kuni avi ngolongondi neju ndava muni avi na vindu vyamahele aganili lepi kuvilekelesa.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Kangi Yesu akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Nikuvajovela chakaka, ndi yinonopa mkolo vindu vyamahele kuyingila muunkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Nikuvajovela kavili yati yiyeyuka kwa hinyama ngati ngamiya kuholota palibowo la sindanu, kuliku mweavi na vindu vyamahele kuyingila muunkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Vawuliwa vala pevayuwini malovi ago vakakangasa neju, vakamkota Yesu, “Hinu ndi yani mweihotola kusanguliwa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu akavalolokesa, akavajovela “Lijambu lenili lihotoleka lepi kwa mundu, nambu kwa Chapanga mambu goha gihotoleka.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Petili akayangula “Lola,” Tete tileki kila chindu ndava ya kukulanda. Yati tipata kyani?<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu akavajovela, “Nikuvajovela chakaka, paitama Mwana wa Mundu pachigoda cha ukulu waki, pamulima wa mupya. Mewawa na nyenye mwemunilandili yati mwitama na nene muvigoda kumi na hivili na kuvahamula makabila kumi na gavili ga Isilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Mundu yeyoha mwaalekili nyumba amala mlongo waki amala mlumbu amala dadi amala nyina waki amala vana vaki amala migunda yaki ndava ya nene. Yati ipokela mala miya na kuhala wumi wa magono goha wangali mwishu. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Nambu vamahele vevavi va kutumbula yati vivya va mwishu na vevavi va mwishu yati vivya va kutumbula.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Vahenga lihengu ku mgunda wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga uwanangini na mkolo mgunda wa mizabibu, mwealavili lukela kuvalonda vandu valihengu mumgunda waki. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Vayidakilini kulipiwa mashonga ga luhuna lwa muhi umonga, akavatuma kumgunda waki wa mizabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Akahuma kavili saa datu lukela, na avaweni vandu vangi vayimili pandu pakugulisila vindu, vangali lihengu. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Akavajovela, ‘Mewawa na nyenye mhamba kulihengu kumgunda wangu wa mizabibu,’ Na nene yati nikuvalipa luhuna lwinu lwemganikiwa mupewayi. <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Hinu, vakahamba. Kangi mkolo mgunda yula akahuma kangi saa sita, na saa tisa, akawuka kangi mewawa. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Hati Payahikili saa kumi na yimonga kimihi, ahumili kangi na kuvakolela vandu vangi vayimili pandu pa kugulisa vindu, hinu, akavakota. ‘Ndava kyani muyimili muhi woha changali lihengu?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Vakamyangula, ‘Ndava kawaka mundu mweatipeli lihengu,’ Mwene akavajovela, na nyenye mhamba mkahenga lihengu kumgunda wa mizabibu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />Payavi kimihi, mkolo mgunda amjovili myimilila lihengu mumgunda, uvakemela vanalihengu uvalipa mashonga gavi, utumbula na vala veuvapeli lihengu pamwishu na umalakisa vala veuvapeli lihengu pakutumbula. <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Hinu vevatumbwili lihengu saa kumi na yimonga kimihi, vabwelili na kila mundu apokili mashonga ga luhuna lwa muhi umonga. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Pavabwelili vala vevatumbwili lihengu peatumbwili vaholali kuvya yati vipokela neju, ndi navene vakapokela mashonga ga luhuna lwa muhi umonga kila mundu. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Pavamali kupokela vakamng'ung'utila mkolo mgunda yula. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Vakamjovela, vandu ava va pamwishu vahengili lihengu nga lisaa limonga, hinu veve uvalipili kuwanangana na tete, kuni tete tiweli na kukangamala mulihengu na lilanga la muhi woha?<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Mkolo mgunda yula, akamyangula mmonga wavi, “Yuwanila, mkozi, nikupunjili lepi chindu! Wu, tayidakilini lepi na veve mashonga ga luhuna lwa muhi umonga? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Hinu tola mashonga ga luhuna lwaku, uhamba. Niganili kumpela wa pamwishu luhuna lwa kuwanangana na veve. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Nihotola lepi kukita chenigana na mashonga gangu? Ukunilolokesa lingele ndava muni nambwina?”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Hinu Yesu amalakisa kwa kujova, “Mewawa wa pamwishu yati vivya wa vakutumbula na vakutumbula yati vivya va pamwishu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ijova mala ya datu ndava ya lifwa laki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maluko 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-40">Luka 18:31-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yesu peavi munjila kuhamba ku Yelusalemu, ndi akavatola vawuliwa vaki kumi na vavili vala kuchiyepela, na munjila kuni vigenda akavajovela. <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Mlola, tihamba ku Yelusalemu kwenuko ndi Mwana wa Mundu yati igotolewa kwa Vakulu va kuteta na vawula va malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa navene yati vakumhamula lifwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Kangi yati vakumgotola kwa vandu vangali Vayawudi, navene yati vakumvevesa na kumtova ndonga, na kumkoma kwa kumvamba pamsalaba nambu paligono la datu yati iyuka.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luyupu lwa mau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maluko 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Penapo nyina wavi vana va Zebedayo amhambili Yesu pamonga na vana vaki vavili, akamfugamila na kumuyupa chila cheigana.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu akamkota, “Ugana kyani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Mau yula akayangula, “Lagazila muunkosi waku vana vangu ava vavili vatama, mmonga upandi waku wa kulyelela na yungi wa kumangeya.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu akamyangula, “Nakuchimanya chemwiyupa. Wu, mwihotola kunywelela chikombi cha mang'ahiso cheninywela nene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Vakamyangula, “Tihotola.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Akavajovela, “Chakaka yati mwinywelela chikombi changu, nambu kumtamisa mundu upandi wa kulyelela amala kumangeya ndi lihengu langu lepi, lijambu lenilo yati vipewa vala vevatendelekiwi na Dadi wangu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Vawuliwa kumi vala pevayuwinili genago, vakavayomela vala valongo vavili. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Nambu Yesu akavakemela pamonga na kuvajovela, “Mwimanya kuvya vachilongosi va mulima vakuvalongosa vandu vavi kwa makakala, na vachilongosi vakuvakita vandu avo kuvya vavi. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Nambu kwinu yikotoka kuvya genago, nambu mweigana kuvya mkulu pagati yinu yikumgana avyai muhengaji winu, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />na yeyoha mweigana kuvya wa kutumbula pagati yinu, yikumgana avyai mtumisi winu. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Ndava muni Mwana wa Mundu nakubwela kuhengewa, nambu kuvahengela na kuwusa wumi waki ndava ya kuvagombola vandu vamahele.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalamisa vangalola vavili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maluko 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yesu na vawuliwa vaki pavawuyayi ku Yeliko msambi uvaha wa vandu vamlandili. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Ndi vangalola vavili vevatamili pamuhana ya njila, pevayuwini kuvya Yesu ibwela na njila yeniyo, vakajova kwa lwami luvaha, “Bambu, Mwana wa Daudi utihengela lipyana.”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Msambi wa vandu wula wavahakalili na kuvajovela vagunai. Nambu vene vakayonjokesa kujova kwa lwami luvaha, “Bambu, Mwana wa Daudi utihengela lipyana!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu akayima akavakemela na kuvakota, “Wu, mwigana nivahengela kyani?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Vakamyangula, “Bambu, tigana kulola.”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Hinu Yesu avahengili lipyana, ndi akavapamisa mumihu gavi, ndi bahapo vakahotola kulola, vakamulanda.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu iyingila ku Yelusalemu kwa chilulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohani 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Yesu na vawuliwa vaki pavahegelili, ku Yelusalemu na kuhika Betifage kuchitumbi cha Mizeituni ndi akavatuma vawuliwa vaki vavili, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />akavajovela, “Muhamba pachijiji cha palongolo yinu yati mwikolela lipunda na mwana waki vakungiwi, muvawopola muniletelayi nene. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Ngati mundu akavakota chochoha, mumjovela, ‘Bambu akumgana,’ Bahapo yati akuvalekela.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Mambu ago gahengiki muni malovi geajovili Mlota wa Chapanga gatimilayi,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Ujovela muji wa Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Lola, Nkosi waku akukubwelela!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Mngolongondi na akweli panani ya lipunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">mwana wa lipunda hinyama yeyigega ndwika.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Mewa vawuliwa vaki vakahamba na kukita ngati chevalagaziwi na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Vamletili lipunda na mwana waki, vakavayambatisa nyula panani yavi, na Yesu akatama panani yaki. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Msambi uvaha wa vandu vadandisi nyula zavi munjila na vangi vadumwili matutu ga mikongo na kudandasa munjila. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Msambi wa vandu vevamlongolili na vevamulandili vala vakajova kwa lwami luvaha. “Ulumbiwa Mwana wa Daudi! Amotisiwa mwenuyo mweibwela paliina la Bambu! Chapanga alumbiwa kunani!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yesu peavi mukuyingila ku Yelusalemu, muji woha wakenyemwiki. Vandu vakotanayi, “Mwenuyu ndi yani?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Vandu vangi pagati ya msambi wula vakayangula, “Mwenuyu ndi Yesu mlota wa Chapanga, kuhuma ku Nazaleti muji wa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihamba pa Nyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maluko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohani 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yesu ayingili paluvanja lwa Nyumba ya Chapanga na kuvavinga vandu voha, vevagulisa na kugula vindu pala, azing'anambwisi meza za vabadilisha mashonga. Pamonga na vigoda vya vagulisa ngunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Akavajovela “Yiyandikwi mu Mayandiku Gamsopi, ‘Nyumba yangu yati yikemiwa nyumba ya kumyupila Chapanga.’ Nambu nyenye muyikitili kuvya libokoselu la vanyagaji.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Vangalola na vachindamile vamhambili Yesu pa Nyumba ya Chapanga, mwene avalamisi. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Nambu Vamteta vakulu va Chapanga na vawula va malagizu vamemili ligoga ndava ya kulola mambu gabwina geahengili Yesu, mewa vana vevajovayi kwa lwami luvaha mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, “Ulumbiwa Mwana wa Daudi.” <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Vakamjovela, “Wu, wiyuwana vana ava chevijova?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yesu akavayangula, “Ena, niyuwana! Wu, mwangasoma mu Mayandiku Gamsopi? Mumilomo ya vana vadebe na vang'enya ndi ujipatili ulumba kamili.”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Kangi Yesu akavaleka, akawuka pamuji wenuwo, akahamba ku Betania akagona kwenuko.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuhupela likoto mkongo wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maluko 11:12-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Chilau yaki lukela Yesu peavi mukuwuya kumuji wenuwo, njala yamvinili. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Auwene mkongo wa mtini mumuhana ya njila, ndi auhambalili, nambu akolili lepi chindu mumkongo wula nga mahamba gene, ndi aupeli likoto akaujovela gakotoka kupambika matunda kutumbula lelu hati magono goha! Bahapo mkongo wula wanyalili.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Vawuliwa pavauweni vakakangaswa na lijambu lenilo vakajova, “Ndava kyani mkongo wa mtini unyalili chighafula?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu akavayangula, “Nikuvajovela chakaka, ngati mwisadika changali mtahu, yati mwihotola lepi ndu kuhenga ago, nambu hati kuchijovela chitumbi, ‘Utupuka apa, na ukujitaga munyanja,’ Yati yivya mewa. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Na chochoha chemwiyupa kwa kumuyupa Chapanga, mwakasadika yati mwipata.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likotesi ndava ya uhotola wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maluko 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu ayingili mu Nyumba ya Chapanga kuwula, hinu peavi mukuwula. Vamteta vakulu na vagogo va vandu vamkotili “Wihenga mambu genago kwa uhotola woki? Ndi yani mweakupeli uhotola wenuwo?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu akavayangula, “Nene yati nikuvakota likotesi limonga, na ngati muniyangwili ndi nene yati nikuvajovela nihenga mambu aga kwa uhotola woki. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Wu, uhotola wa Yohani Mbatizaji wahumili koki? Wu, wahumili kunani kwa Chapanga amala wahumili kwa vandu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Nambu vakajovesana vene kwa vene, “Tikajova, ‘Wahumili kunani kwa Chapanga? Yati akutikota, ndava kyani nakusadika?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Na ngati tijovili, gahumili kwa vandu, tiyogopa msambi wa vandu muni voha viyidakila kuvya Yohani ndi mlota wa Chapanga.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Hinu vamyangwili, “Nakumanya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Namwene Yesu akavajovela na nene nikuvajovela lepi, nihenga mambu aga kwa uhotola woki.<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa vana vavili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Nyenye mwihololela wuli, mundu mmonga avili na vasongolo vavili. Akatumbula kumjovela yula wa kutumbula, mwana vangu lelu uhamba kumgunda wangu wa mizabibu ukahenga lihengu. <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Msongolo yula akamyangula, ‘Mbwitu,’ Nambu mwanakandahi ang'anamwisi maholo gaki, akahamba kuhenga lihengu. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Yula dadi akamjovela mwana wa pili galagala. Namwene akayidakila ena Dadi, Nambu nakuhamba. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Wu, yani pagati ya vavili venavo mweahengili maganu ga dadi waki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Vakamyangula, “Mwana wa utumbula yula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Hinu, Yesu akavajovela, “Nikuvajovela chakaka vatola kodi na vakemi yati vakuvalongolela kuyingila muunkosi wa Chapanga.” <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Muni Yohani abwelili kwinu na kuvalangisa njila ya kumganisa Chapanga, nyenye nakuyisadika, nambu vatola kodi na vakemi vamsadiki. Hati pamonga na kugalola genago goha, nambu nyenye nakumuwuyila Chapanga na kumsadika.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa ku mgunda wa mizabibu na valimaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maluko 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yesu akajova, “Myuwana luhumu lungi,” Mundu mmonga mkolo nyumba alimili mgunda wa mizabibu, akatindisila luwumba, na kugima chiliva cha kuminyila divayi na akajenga mnala. Kangi avakodisi valimaji, akahamba mulima wa kutali. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Lukumbi lwa kubena pwalahikili, ndi avatumili vatumisi vaki kwa valimaji vala, muni vakatola lilundu laki la mabenu. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Nambu valimaji vala vavakamwili vatumisi venavo, mmonga vakamtova na yungi vakamkoma, na yungi vakamtova na maganga. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Kangi mkolo mgunda akavatuma vatumisi vangi vamahele neju kuliku vala va kutumbula. Hinu valimajii vala vakavahengela mewawa. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Pamwishu ndi amtumili mwana waki, muni aholalili kuvya. Chakaka yati vakumutopesa mwana vangu. <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Nambu valimaji vala pevamuwene mwana waki, vakajovesana vene kwa vene, mwenuyu ndi mhali waki, timkoma muni mgunda wenuwu tihala tete! <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Hinu, vakamkamula na kumtaga kuvala ya mgunda wa mizabibu, ndi vakamkoma.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Kangi Yesu akavakota “Hinu mkolo mgunda wa mizabibu paibwela yati akuvakita kyani valimaji vala?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />“Vene vakamyangula, yati akuvakoma valimaji venavo na mgunda wula yati akuvapela valimaji vangi vevakumpela lilundu laki la mabenu lukumbi lwa kubena.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yesu akavajovela, “Wu, mwangasoma mu Mayandiku Gamsopi?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Liganga levabeli vakujenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">hinu ndi liganga likulu la kukamulila nyumba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Bambu ndi mweahengili lijambu lenili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">ndi la kukangasa neju kwitu!<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Ndava muni nikuvajovela, “Unkosi wa Chapanga yati uwusiwa kwinu na yati vipewa vandu va mulima wungi vala vevihenga gegakumganisa Chapanga.” <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Yeyoha mweigwilila paliganga lenilo yati idenyekana hipandi hipandi na yeyoha mwelikumgwilila yati likumuyaga nyiminyimi.<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Ndi vamteta vakulu na Vafalisayu pevayuwini miluhumu ya Yesu ndi vamanyalili kuvya akuvajova vene. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Vene pevalondili njila ya kumkamula, vayogwipi msambi wa vandu muni vene vammanyili kuvya mwene ndi mlota wa Chapanga.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Mselebuko wa chakulya cha ndowa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu ajovili nawu kavili kwa miluhumu, akajova. <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga uwanangini na nkosi mweamtendelekili mwana waki mselebuko wa ndowa. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Avatumili vatumisi kuvakemela veavagongolili kundowa, nambu vene vabeli kubwela. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Kangi avatumili vatumisi vangi, akajova muvajovela venivagongolili vala, Mselebuko wula nimali kutendelekela, nimali kuhinja ng'ombi yigosi na mpapakasi yeyikulupili, nitendelekili kila chindu, mbwela kundowa! <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Nambu vevagongoliwi valitopisi lepi lijambu lila, vakahambanila, mmonga kumgunda waki na yungi kumahengu gaki, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />na vangi vavakamwili vatumisi vala vakavaliga na kuvakoma. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Nkosi yula akayoma, ndi akavatuma manjolinjoli vaki vahamba kuvakomekesa vakomaji venavo na kuyocha muji wavi <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Kangi akavajovela vatumisi vaki, ‘Mselebuko wa ndowa ndi umali kutendekelewa, nambu venivagongolili vala nakuganikiwa kubwela. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Hinu, mhamba hati munjila, voha vemkuvakolela mvakemela vabwela kundowa.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Vatumisi vala vakawuka na kuhamba munjila, vavakemela vandu voha vevavakolili, vandu vabwina na vahakau, nyumba ya ndowa yikamema vayehe.”<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Nkosi avawene paayingili kuvalola vayehe, amuwene mundu mmonga mwaangawala nyula za ndowa. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Nkosi akamkota, ‘Nkozi uyingi wuli penapa changawala nyula za pandowa?’ Nambu mwene agunili. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Kangi nkosi akavajovela vahengaji, ‘Mumkunga magendelu na mawoko mumtaga kuvala kuchitita, kwenuko yati ivemba na kuyaga minu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Yesu akamalakisila kujova, “Vamahele vagongoliwi, nambu vevahaguliwi vadebe.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulipa kodi kwa nkosi mkulu wa Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maluko 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Kangi Vafalisayu vakawuka, vakajovesana ndava ya kumuyonja Yesu kwa malovi gaki. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Ndi vavatumili vamulanda vavi pamonga na vamulanda va chikundi cha Helodi. Vamkota, “Muwula,” “Timanyili kuvya veve ndi mundu wa chakaka, wiwula njila ya Chapanga muuchakaka, changayogopa vandu vijova kyani muni ulongosi wa mundu chindu lepi kwa veve. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Hinu tijovela, uholalela wuli? Wu, chabwina amala lepi, tete kulipa kodi kwa nkosi wa ku Loma ndi mewa ikemelewa Kaisali?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Nambu, Yesu amanyili uhakau wavi, akavajovela, “Nyenye vahomela ndava kyani mukunilinga? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Mnilangisa lishonga la kulipila kodi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Vene vakamlangisa lishonga. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Ndi, Yesu akavakota, “Pamihu apa na liina lenili vyeviyandikwi penapa ndi vya yani?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Vakamyangula “Ya nkosi wa ku Loma.” Penapo Yesu akavajovela, “Hinu mumpela nkosi wa ku Loma vyaki nkosi wa ku Loma na mumpela Chapanga vyaki Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Pevayuwini genago vakakangasa, vakamleka vakawuka.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likotesi ndava ya kuyuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maluko 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Ligono lenilo pagati ya Vasadukayu vangi vevijova vandu vevafwili viyuka lepi, vamhambalili Yesu na kumkota, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />vakamjovela “Muwula, Musa atijovili mundu mweagegili afwili changaleka vana, yikumgana mlongo waki amhala lipwela mwenuyo, muni ambabakisila vana mlongo waki <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Hinu pitu apa pavili na valongo saba. Mwaatumbwili kugega afwili changaleka vana, na mlongo waki amgegili lipwela mwenuyo. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Hinu yavi mewawa kwa valongo vangi wa pili na wa datu, mbaka voha saba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Pavamali kufwa valongo venavo voha, ndi na mdala yula afwili. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Wu, pa ligono la kuyuka yati ivya mdala wa yani pagati ya valongo vala? Muni voha saba vagegini nayu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu akavayangula “Nyenye mubudili ndava muni nakumanya Mayandiku Gamsopi wala makakala ga Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Muni vevafwili paviyuka yati vigega lepi wala kugegewa, ndi vivya ngati vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Nambu ndava ya kuyuka kwa vevafwili, wu, mwangasoma geavajovili Chapanga? Avajovili, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Nene ndi Chapanga wa Ibulahimu, Chapanga wa Izaki na Chapanga wa Yakobo.’ Hinu mwene ndi lepi Chapanga wa vevafwili, nambu ndi Chapanga wa vakona wumi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Msambi wa vandu wula pevayuwini malovi ago, ukakangasa ndava ya mawuliwu gaki.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhilu ukulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maluko 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Vafalisayu pevayuwini kuvya Yesu avagunisi Vasadukayu, vakakonganeka pamonga. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Mmonga pagati yavi, mweavimmanya malagizu bwina, amkotili Yesu cha kumlinga, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Muwula ndi muhilu woki ukulu mu malagizu?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu akayangula, “‘Mgana Bambu Chapanga waku, mumtima waku woha, mumpungu waku woha na muluhala lwaku lwoha.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Yeniyi ndi muhilu ukulu ndi wa kutumbukana. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Na ya pili yeyiwanangana na yeniyi, ‘Ndi mgana muyaku ngati chaukujigana wamwene.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Malagizu goha ga Musa na mawuliwu ga vamlota va Chapanga gihuvalila mihilu yeniyo yivili.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likotesi kumvala Kilisitu Msangula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maluko 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Vafalisayu pavakonganiki pamonga, Yesu avakotili, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Nyenye mwihololela wuli ndava ya Kilisitu? Mwana wa yani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Vakamyangula “Mwene ndi mwana wa Daudi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yesu, akavajovela, “Ndava kyani,” Kwa makakala ga Mpungu Msopi? Daudi akumkemela mwene Bambu? Muni ajovili,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />Bambu amjovili Bambu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">tama muchiwoko changu cha kulyelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">mbaka nivavika vamakoko vaku kuvya pahi ya magendelu gaku.<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Hinu, ngati Daudi akumkemela, Kilisitu Bambu, yihotoleka wuli kuvya mwana waki?<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Avi lepi mundu mweahotwili kumyangula linenu. Kutumbula ligono lenilo kawaka mundu mwalingili kumkota kangi.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Mujiyangalilayi ndava vawula va malagizu na Vafalisayu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Maluko 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luka 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Kangi Yesu akaujovela msambi wa vandu pamonga na vawuliwa vaki, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Vawula va malagizu na Vafalisayu ndi vevavi na uhotola wa kudandaula malagizu ga Musa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Hinu mugakamula na kugalanda malovi goha gevakuvajovela, nambu mkoto kuyigila matendu gavi, muni vene vihenga lepi gala gevikokosa. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Vene vikunga ndwika yeyitopa na kuvagegesa vandu mumavega gavi, kuni vene vaganili lepi hati kutalambula lungonji kutangatila kugega. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Vene vihenga kila chindu, ndava kulolekana na vandu, viwala vindu vivaha vyeviyandikiwi malagizu pamihu gavi na mumawoko na kutalambula lugunyilu lwa nyula zavi. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Vigana kutama muvigoda vya palongolo pa mselebuko, na muvigoda vya kulongolo munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi, <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />mewawa vigana kujambuswa cha kutopeswa pandu pa kugulisila na kugula vindu na kukemelewa, ‘Muwula.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Nambu nyenye mkoto kuyidakila kukemelewa ‘Muwula,’ Ndava muni mwavoha nyenye mwavalukolo na Muwula winu ndi mmonga. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Mewa mkoto kumkemela mundu yeyoha pamulima apa dadi, muni Dadi winu ndi mmonga ndu mweavi kunani. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Mkoto kuyidakila kukemelewa vachilongosi, muni chilongosi winu ndi mmonga ndu, ndi Kilisitu Msangula. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Mweavi mvaha pagati yinu yikumgana avyai muhengaji winu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Na yeyoha mweakujikwiha yati iheleswa, na mweakujihelesa yati ikwihiwa.”<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu avalaumu vandu vevakujikita vabwina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maluko 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Mwalachikolela nyenye vawula va malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa na Vafalisayu! Mukujikita vabwina! Mwidinda mlyangu wa unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga palongolo ya mihu ga vandu, mwavene mwiyingila lepi mugati na kuni mukuvayidakila lepi vevigana kuyingila vayingila. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Mwalachikolela nyenye, vawula va malagizu na Vafalisayu, mukujikita vabwina! Ndava muni mwinyaga vindu vya valipwela na kujilangisa kuvya vandu mwemkumganisa Chapanga, kwa kumuyupa Chapanga mulukumbi lutali, ndava yeniyo uhamula winu yati yivya yivaha neju.”<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Mwalachikolela nyenye vawula va malagizu ga Bambu geampeli Musa na Vafalisayu, mukujikita vabwina! Muvi mulugendu munyanja na mundumba, muni mwilonda mundu mmonga alanda njila yinu ya kumuyupa Chapanga. Pemukumpata mukumkita iganikiwa neju kuhamba mumotu wa magono goha wangajimika kuliku mwavene.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Mwalachikolela nyenye vilongosi vangalola! Mwemwijova ngati mundu alapili mu Nyumba ya Chapanga chindu lepi, nambu mundu akalapa kwa zahabu yeyivii mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, ndi chilapu chenicho chikumukamula. <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Nyenye mwangalola vayimu! Choki chivaha neju, zahabu amala Nyumba ya Chapanga yeyikuinyambisa zahabu kuvya msopi? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Mwijova kavili mewawa kuvya mundu akalapa kwa pandu pa kuwusila teta ndi chindu lepi, nambu mundu akalapai na luteta lweluvikiwi panani ya pandu pa kuwusila teta penapo ndi chilapu chenicho yati chikumukamula. <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Mwangalola nyenye! Choki chivaha neju luteta amala pandu pa kuwusila teta pepikita njombi kuvya ya ya msopi? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Hinu, mundu mweilapa mu pandu pa kuwusila teta, alapili kwa pandu pa kuwusila teta na vindu vyoha vyevivi panani yaki. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Mewawa na mweilapa kwa Nyumba ya Chapanga alapili kwa yeniyo na mwenuyo mwaitama mugati yaki. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Na mweilapa kwa liina la kunani kwa Chapanga, alapili pachigoda cha unkosi wa Chapanga, na kwa mwene mweitama pachigoda chenicho.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Mwalachikolela nyenye vawula va Malagizu na Vafalisayu. Mwavahomela! Mukuvawusa vandu lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi hati panani ya manyahi geginungalila bwina, bizali na ndimbililu, kuni mwileka mambu gavaha ga malagizu ngati kumganisa Chapanga lipyana na sadika. Genago ndi ngamlongolili kuhenga changali kuleka gangi gala. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Vachilongosi ngalola mwiwusa livembe muminyweso, kuni mwimila hinyama yeyikemelewa ngamiya!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Mwalachikolela nyenye vawula va malagizu na Vafalisayu, mwavahomela! Mwisanja chikombi na nkeve cha kuvala, kuni muleka mugati mumemili vindu vyemupatili kwa uhiji na kunota. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Veve Mfalisayu ngalola! Tumbula hoti kusanja chikombi na nkele mugati na kuvala yati kwinyamba mewa.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />Mwalachikolela nyenye, Vawula va malagizu na Vafalisayu, mwemukujikita vabwina! Mwiwanangana ngati matinda gevabakili chokaa gegiloleka kuvala ganyambili, nambu mugati gamemili majege ga mituhi ya vandu vevafwili kwa uhakasa ndalindali. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Mewawa nyenye chakuvala mwiloleka ngati vandu vevakumganisa Chapanga, nambu mugati mumemili uhomela na uhakau.”<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilotela uhamula wewibwela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Mwalachikolela nyenye vawula va malagizu na Vafalisayu, mwavahomela! Mwijenga matinda ga vamlota va Chapanga na kunyambisa matinda ga vandu vevamganisi Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Ndi mwijova, ‘Kuvya mutama lusenje lwa vagogo vinu tihanganili lepi nawu, kuvakoma vamlota va Chapanga!’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Hinu, mwavene mukujilangisa kuvya nyenye ndi vana va vandu vala, vevavakomili vamlota va Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Hinu mumalakisa lihengu levatumbwili vagogo vinu! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Nyenye mayoka chiveleku cha mayoka! Yani mweakuvajovela muhotola kutila ligono la uhamula wa Chapanga? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Ndava yeniyo nikuvapelekela vamlota va Chapanga, na vandu vevana luhala na vawula va malagizu, vangi pagati yavi yati mukuvakoma na kuvavamba mu msalaba na vangi yati mukuvatova ndonga munyumba zinu za kukonganekela Vayawudi, na vangi yati mukuvajumbisa kuhuma muji umonga mbaka muji wungi. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Ndi panani yinu mwigega ngasi ya vandu voha vevamganisi Chapanga yeyiyitiki pamulima. Kutumbula kukomiwa kwa Abeli mweangabuda mbaka Zakalia, mwana wa Balakia, mwemwamkomili mu Nyumba ya Chapanga pagati ya pandu pamsopi pa kuwusila teta. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Nikuvajovela chakaka, chiveleku ichi yati chihamuliwa ndava ya mambu genago.”<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu cheavaganili vandu va Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Yelusalemu! Veve Yelusalemu ukuvakoma vamlota va Chapanga na kuvatova maganga vala venivatumili kwa veve! Mala yilinga niganilli kuvavika pamonga vana vaku, ngati ng'uku cheyikuvayuvatila vana mumagwaba gaki, nambu mwaganili lepi! <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Lola, Nyumba ya Chapanga waku yati yisigalila mang'ova. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Muni nikuvajovela kutumbula hinu yati nakunilola kavili mbaka mulukumbi pemwijova, ‘Amotisiwa mwenuyo mweibwela kwa liina la Bambu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ilongela ndava ya kugwiswa kwa Nyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maluko 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yesu awukili mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, peavi mukuhamba vawuliwa vaki vambwelili na kumlangisa Nyumba ya Chapanga cheyijengiwi. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Yesu akavajovela, “Ena, mwihotola kugalola goha aga! Nikuvajovela chakaka, kawaka hati liganga limonga lelisigilila panani ya liganga lingi kila limonga yati litagiwa pahi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ani na mang'ahiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maluko 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yesu peatamili panani ya chitumbi cha mizeituni, vawuliwa vamhambili pachiepela, vakamkota, “Utijovela mambu ago yati gihumila ndali?” Ulangisu woki weulangisa kubwela kwaki na pamwishu wa mulima?<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu akavayangula, mujiyangalila mundu akotoka kuvakonga. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Ndava muni vamahele yati vibwela kwa liina langu, yati vijova nene ndi Kilisitu Msangula! Na kuvakonga vandu vamahele. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Nambu mwiyuwana malovi ga ngondo na lwami lwa ngondo, nambu mkoto kuyogopa, muni genago goha giganikiwa kuhumila, nambu mwishu wene wakona. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Vandu va mulima umonga yati vitovana na mulima wungi, unkosi umonga yati utovana na unkosi wungi. Kuni na kula yati kwivya na njala na mindendemo ya ndima. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Genago goha yati givya ngati utumbula wa lipyanda la kuvelekewa mwana.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Kangi yati vakuvagotola mung'aiswa na kukomiwa. Yati mwivya vandu va kuyomewa na vandu va milima yoha ndava ya kunisadika nene. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Lukumbi lwenulo vamahele yati vakuyileka sadika yavi kung'anamukilana na kuyomelana. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Yati vihumila vamlota va udesi vamahele yati vakuvakonga vandu vamahele. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Ndava ya kuyonjokeseka neju uhakau ndi uganu wa vandu vamahele yati wipungula. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Nambu mweisindimala mbaka pamwishu ndi mweisanguliwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Linenu la Bwina yati likokoselewa pamilima yoha muni vandu voha vayuwanayi kwakona mwishu kuhika.”<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chindu chechiyomesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maluko 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Hinu pemwilola ‘Chindu chechiyomesa’ Chechijoviwi na Danieli mweavi mlota wa Chapanga liyimili pandu Pamsopi pa Nyumba ya Chapanga,” Mweisoma na amanyai, <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />penapo ndi vevavi ku Yudea vajumbalila kuchitumbi. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Mweavi kunani ya nyumba yaki akotoka kuhuluka kutola chindu munyumba yaki. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Na mundu mweavikumgunda akotoka kuwuya mumbele, kutola nyula yaki. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Lukumbi lwenulo vamau mwemuvi na ndumbu na mwemunyong'esa yati mwing'aika neju! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Ndi mumuyupayi Chapanga kutila kwinu kukotoka kuvya mu ligono la mbepu amala Ligono la Kupumulila! <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Ndava muni lukumbi lwenulo yati kwivya na mang'ahiso gakulu gangahumila kuhuma kutumbula kwa mulima mbaka lelu, katu yihumila lepi kavili. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Ngati magono genago yagapungwizwi lepi, kawaka mundu mweasanguliwi, nambu ndava ya vevahaguliwi vala ndi magono genago gapungwizi.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />“Hinu, magono genago mundu akavajovela, ‘Lola, Kilisitu Msangula!’ ‘Avi apa amala avi pala!’ Mkoto kusadika. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Muni yati vihumila vakina Kilisitu vangi va udesi na vamlota va udesi. Yati vihenga ulangisu uvaha na gachinamtiti muni vavakonga yikahotoleka hati vevahaguliwi na Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Myuwanila, nimali kuvajovela, kwakona lukumbi kubwela.”<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Hinu ngati vakavajovelai mlola Kilisitu Msangula, avi kulugangatu, mkotoka kuhamba, amala mlola ajifiyili mugati, mkoto kusadika, <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Ndava kubwela kwa Mwana wa Mundu yati kulolekana ngati lumuli lwa mbamba chelumweta kuhuma kwe lihumila lilanga mbaka kwe litipama lilanga.<verse eid="MAT 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Pala peuvi mtuhi ndi pagikonganeka manditi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela kwa Mwana wa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maluko 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Bahapo pegimalika mang'ahiso ga magono ago, lilanga yati lisopiwa chitita, mwehi lwalava lepi na lumuli, ndondo yati zigwa kuhumila kunani kumahundi, na makakala vindu vevivi kunani yati vinyugusika. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Kangi, ulangisu wa Mwana wa Mundu yati yiwonekana kunani, ndi penapo makabila goha ga pamulima apa yati givembeneka kumuyupa Chapanga, yati vakumlola Mwana wa Mundu ibwela kuhuma kunani ku mahundi avi na makakala na ukulu neju. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Lwami luvaha lwa lipenenga yati luyuwanika, mwene akuvatuma vamitumu vaki va kunani kwa Chapanga na kuhamba kuvakemela vala voha vevahaguliwi na Chapanga, kuhuma pandi zoha mcheche za mulima, kuhuma mwishu umonga wa pamulima mbaka mwishu uwu wungi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa mkongo wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maluko 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Mujiwula kuhuma mkongo wa mtini, bahapo limbanda laki lakatumbula kumela na kuhomola mahamba, mwimanya kuvya lukumbi lwa kubena luvi papipi. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Mewawa na nyenye pemwilola mambu genago goha chegihumila, mumanya kuvya lukumbi luvi papipi. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Chakaka nikuvajovela, chiveleku chenichi chipita lepi kwakona mambu genago kuhumila. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Kunani kwa Chapanga na pamulima yati ziwuka, nambu malovi gangu katu giwuka lepi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawaka mweimanya ligono amala lukumbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maluko 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Nambu kulivala ligono amala lisaa lenilo, avi lepi mundu mwaimanya lubwela ndali, hati vamitumu va kunani amala Mwana. Nga Dadi mwene ndi mweimanya. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Ndava muni ngati chayavi lusenje lwa Nuhu, ndi mewawa cheyivya peibwela Mwana wa Mundu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Muni lusenje lwenulo kwakona kutonya fula yikulu, vandu vakalilya na kunywa, na vigega na kugegewa, mbaka lukumbi Nuhu peayingili muwatu uvaha weukemiwa Safina. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Vamanyili lepi chechahumila mbaka fula yikulu payabweli na kuvayola voha. Ndi yivya mewawa paibwela Mwana wa Mundu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Lukumbi lwenulo vandu vavili yati vivya kumgunda mmonga yati itoliwa na yungi yati ilekewa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Vamau vavili yati vivya mukuyaga mabenu, mmonga yati itoliwa na yungi ilekewa.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Hinu, mujiyangalila! Ndava muni mmanyi lepi ligono la kubwela Bambu winu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Nambu mumanya lijambu lenili, ngati mkolo nyumba kuvya amanyai ligono leibwela mhiji, ngaajitendekili, ngaayileki lepi nyumba yaki yidenyewayi na mhiji. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Ndava yeniyo, mewawa nyenye mujitendelekela, muni Mwana wa Mundu yati ibwela lisaa mwangalimanya.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumisi msadikika na angasadikika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Yesu akayendelela kujova, “Wu, yani ndi mtumisi msadikika na mweavi na luhala? Mkulu waki amuvikii kuvayimalila vatumisi vayaki, avapela chakulya pa lukumbi lwaki. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Ahekayi mtumisi yula, mkulu waki akawuya yati akumkolela ihenga mewa. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Nikuvajovela chakaka, mkulu waki yati akumvika mtumisi mwenuyo kuvya myimilila wa vindu vyaki vyoha. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Nambu ngati mtumisi yula mhakau akahololela mumtima waki kuvya mkulu waki ichelewa kuwuya, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />kangi itumbula kuvatova vatumisi na kutumbula kulya na kunywa pamonga na vachigaligali. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Mkulu waki yati iwuya ligono angalimanya na lisaa angahololela. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Mkulu waki yati akumdumulana neju hipandi na kumvika lilundu limonga na la vandu vevakujikita vabwina kwenuko ndi yati ivemba na kuyaga minu.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa vasikana kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />Kangi lukumbi lwenulo, Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga uwanangana na vakamwali kumi vevagegili hahi zavi, vevahambili kumlindila mkolo ndowa. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Mhanu pagati yavi vavi vayimu na mhanu vangi vavi na luhala. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Vala vayimu vagegii hahi zavi, nambu vagegili lepi mahuta gangi gachibana. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Nambu vevavi na luhala vala vagegili mahuta muchupa na mu hahi zavi. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Ndava muni mkolo ndowa acheliwi kubwela, ndi vasikana vala vatumbwili kutitila na vakagona.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Pagati ya kilu lwami luvaha lwayuwaniki, ‘Yumuka, mkolo ndowa ibwela mhamba mukampokela!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Kangi vakamwali vala voha vakayumuka, na kutendelekela hahi zavi. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Vayimu vala vakavajovela vayavi vevavi na luhala, mutitangatila mahuta ginu padebe, ndava muni hahi zitu zijimika. <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Nambu vevavi na luhala vala vakavayangula, lepi, ‘Gikola lepi, nyenye na tete.’ ‘Mbanga mhamba kuliduka mukajigulila mwavene.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Hinu, vakamwali vayimu vala, pevahambili kugula mahuta, mkolo ndowa ndi abwelili, vevajitendelekili vala vayingili munyumba ya ndowa pamonga nayu, kangi mlyangu wadindiwi.”<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Mwanakandahi vakawuya vakamwali vangi vala, vakakemela “Mkulu, ‘Mkulu, tidindulila!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Nambu mkulu yula akavayangula, ‘Nikuvajovela chakaka, nakuvamanya nyenye.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Kangi Yesu akavajovela, “Mujiyangalila! Ndava mwimanya lepi ligono amala lisaa yeibwela Mwana wa Mundu.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa vatumisi vadatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-17">Luka 19:11-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Kangi Unkosi wa kunani kwa Chapanga uwanangana ngati mundu mmonga mweaganili kuhamba lugendu lwa kutali, avakemili vatumisi vaki na kuvagotolela vindu vyaki. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Akavapela kila mundu ngati cheavi na uhotola waki, mmonga mahaku mhanu ga mashonga na yungi mahaku gavili ga mashonga na yungi talanta yimonga ya mashonga akahamba. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Yula mweagotoliwi talanta mhanu za mashonga, bahapo akazihengela lihengu na, kuziyonjokesa mahaku gangi mhanu. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Mewawa yungi mweagotoliwi mahaku gavili ga mashonga, akayonjokesa mahaku gangi gavili. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Nambu mtumisi mweagotoliwi talanta yimonga ya lishonga akahamba kugimila pahi, kuyifiya mashonga ga mkulu waki.”<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Pagamaliki magono gamahele, mkulu yula awuyili na kutumbula kuvalanga vindu mashonga gaki pamonga nawu. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Yula mtumisi mweagotoliwi mahaku mhanu ga mashonga abwelili kuni agegili mahaku ga mashonga gangi mhanu, ndi akamjovela, ‘Mkulu, wanipeli talanta mashonga mhanu, hinu niyonjokisi talanta zingi mhanu zeniyonjokisi.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Mkulu waki, akamjovela ‘Uhengili chabwina, mtumisi msadikika na mbwina.’ Usadikiwi mu mambu gadebe yati nikugotolela mambu gavaha. Bwelayi uhekayi pamonga na mkulu waku!”<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Kangi mtumisi yungi mweagotoliwi mahaku gavili ga mashonga, abwelili, na kujova, ‘Mkulu wanigotolili mahaku gavili ga mashonga, lola aga apa mahaku gangi gavili geayonjokisi.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />‘Mkulu waki akamjovela, chabwina, veve mtumisi msadikika na mbwina!’ ‘Ukitili chabwina mu mambu gadebe, yati nikugotolela mambu gavaha, bwelayi uhekayi pamonga na nene.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />“Nambu yula mweagotoliwi talanta yimonga ya lishonga, abwelili akajova, ‘Mkulu nikumanyili veve wa mundu munonopo wibena pewangalima, na kutola pewangadandasa mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Ndi nayogwipi, nagimili pandima na kufiya lishonga laku. Hinu ndi utola yaku.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />“‘Mkulu waki akamyangula veve mtumisi mhakau na mkata! Wimanya kuvya nene nibena panangagaba, na kuyola pala panangadandasa?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Ndi yakuganili uvika mashonga gangu kwa vandu vevibadilisha na kuwusa mashonga, ndi nene nganitoli chiyonjokesu na mashonga gangu! <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Hinu mumnyaga mashonga genago, na mumpelayi yula mweavi na talanta kumi za mashonga. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Ndava, mundu yeyoha mweavi na chindu yati ipewa na kuyonjokesewa. Nambu yula angali chindu, hati chidebe cheavili nachu yati inyagiwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Na mtumisi yula angali chiyonjokesu, mtaga kuvala kuchitita kwenuko ndi yati kuvya na luvembu na kuyaga minu.”<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhamula wa mwishu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Lukumbi Mwana wa Mundu peibwela muukulu waki pamonga na vamitumu vaki va kunani kwa Chapanga, penapo yati itama panani ya chigoda cha unkosi chechivii na ukulu. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Vandu va milima yoha yati vikonganeka pamonga palongolo yaki. Mwene ndi akuvapangula vandu ngati mdimaji cheipangula mambelele na mene. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Mwene yati ivika mambelele ndi vandu vabwina palongolo ya Chapanga muchiwoko chaki cha kulyela na mene ndi vandu vahakau muchiwoko chaki cha kumangeya.” <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Kangi Nkosi akuvajovela vala vevavi upandi waki wa kulyela, mbwela, nyenye mwemumotisiwi na Dadi wangu! Mupokela unkosi wemuvikiwi kutumbula kuwumbwa kwa mulima. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Muni penavi na njala mwanipeli chakulya, navi na njota mwanipeli manji, avi myehe mwanipokili panyumba yinu, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />navi nangayatila mwaniwaliki, navi mtamu mwabweli kunilola, navi muchifungu mwanigendelili kunilola.<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />“Penapo vandu vabwina palongolo ya Chapanga yati vakamyangula ‘Bambu, takuwene ndali njala yikuvina petakupeli chakulya, amala uvi na njota tete takupeli manji? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Ndali takuwene wa myehe ndi tete takupokili, amala wavi changayatila takuwaliki? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Ndali patakuwene una utamu amala muchifungu tabweli kukulola?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Nkosi yati akuvayangula, ‘Nikuvajovela chakaka, chindu chochoha chamumhengili mmonga wa valongo vangu vadebe ava, mwanihengili nene.’”<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Kangi yati akuvajovela vala va upandi wa kumangeya, ‘Muwuka, palongolo yangu nyenye mwempewili likoto mhamba kumotu wangajimika wa magono goha gangali mwishu weutendelekiwi kwa Setani na vamitumu vaki. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Ndava njala peyanivili nyenye mwanipeli lepi chakulya, penavi na njota nyenye mwanipeli lepi manji. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Penavi myehe nyenye mwenipokili lepi, penavi changayatila nyenye mwaniwaliki lepi, penavi mtamu na penavi muchifungu nyenye mwabweli lepi kunilola.’”<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />“Penapo yati viyangula, ‘Bambu, ndali petakuwene njala yikuvina, amala uvi na njota amala myehe amala changayatila nyula amala mtamu amala muchifungu tete takuhengili lepi?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Bambu yati iyangula, ‘Nikuvajovela chakaka, chindu chochoha chamwabeli kumuhengela, mmonga wa vadebe ava, ndi mwabeli kunihengela nene.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Hinu, venava yati vihamba kumbunu wa magono goha, nambu vala vandu vabwina palongolo ya Chapanga yati vihamba kuwumi wa magono goha gangali mwishu.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Mpangu wa kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maluko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohani 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yesu peamalakisi kujova malovi genago, ndi akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Mumanyili kuvya gasigalili magono gavili, yati kwivya na mselebuko wa Pasaka, hinu Mwana wa Mundu yati igotolewa muni avambiwa na kufwa pamsalaba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Lukumbi lwenulo vakulu va kuteta na vawula va Malagizu vakonganiki pamonga muluvanja lwa mteta mkulu liina laki Kayafa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Vakajovesana ndava ya kumkamula Yesu kwa mfiyu na kumkoma. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />“Vakajova, nambu tikotoka kuhenga lijambu lenili lukumbi lwa mselebuko wa pasaka, muni vandu vakotoka kuhenga chitututu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vakumnyala mahuta ku Betania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maluko 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohani 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yesu peavi ku Betania, ku nyumba ya Simoni mweavi na mabudi, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />mau mmonga mweavi na kachupa ya alabasta kamahuta geginungalila bwina na ga mashonga gamahele, ambwelili na kumyitila pamutu Yesu peilya chakulya. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Hinu vawuliwa vaki pavagaweni genago vayomili, vakakota, “Luyagu lwenulo lwa kyani?” <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />“Ndava mahuta ago geginungalila bwina ngagaguliswi kwa mashonga gamahele, na kuvapela vangangu mashonga ago!”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yesu agamanyili maholo gavi, ndi akavajovela, “Ndava kyani mukumung'aha mau mwenuyu? Mwene anihengili lijambu labwina neju. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Ndava muni yati mwivya na vangangu pamonga nawu magono goha, nambu nene yati nakuvya pamonga na nyenye magono goha. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Mau mwenuyu aniyitili mahuta geginungalila bwina ndava kunitendelekeha higa yangu kwa maziku. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Nikuvajovela chakaka, pamulima poha Linenu la Bwina lenili pelikokoselewa, chitendu cheahengili mau uyu yati chiluwuliwa ndava ya kumkumbuka mwene.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda iyidakila kumung'anamukila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maluko 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Kangi mmonga pagati ya vawuliwa vaki kumi na vavili vala mweikemiwa Yuda Isikalioti, akahamba kwa vakulu va kuteta, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />akavakota, “Yati mukunipela kyani ngati nivagotolili Yesu?” Vamvalangili hipandi selasini vya madini ga feza. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Kutumbula ligono lenilo Yuda akalonda nafwasi ya kumng'anamukila.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na vawuliwa vaki vilya chakulya cha Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maluko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohani 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Ligono la kutumbula kwakona mselebuko wa mabumunda gangali ngemeku, ndi vawuliwa vamhambili Yesu vakamkota, “Wigana koki tikutendelekeha chakulya cha Pasaka?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Mwene akavayangula, “Mhamba kumuji kwa mgosi mmonga na kumjovela,” Muwula ajovili, ligono laki lihegelili nene na vawuliwa vangu yati tilya chakulya cha Pasaka kwa veve.<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Vawuliwa vakatendelekela ngati Yesu cheavalagizili vakatendelekela chakulya cha Pasaka.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Palatipimi lilanga, Yesu atamili kulya chakulya pamonga na vawuliwa vaki voha kumi na vavili. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Pavavi mukulya, Yesu akavajovela, “Nikuvajovela chakaka mmonga winu yati akuning'anamukila.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Vawuliwa vakavya vakaviniswa neju mtima, vakatumbula kukotana mmonga mmonga, “Bambu! Wu, ndi nene?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu akayangula “Mweijwiga libumunda munkeve pamonga na nene ndi mweakuning'anamukila. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Mwana wa Mundu yati ifwa ngati chegijova Mayandiku Gamsopi, nambu alachikolela mundu yula mweamng'anamukila! Ngayivii mbanga mundu mwenuyo ngaavelekewi lepi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yuda ndi mweamung'anamukili, akamkota “Muwula wu, ndi nene?” Yesu akayangula “Ujovili wamwene.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chakulya cha Bambu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maluko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Vakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Pevavi mukulya, Yesu akatola libumunda, akamsengusa Chapanga akayimetula, akavapela vawuliwa vaki akajova, “Mtola mlyayi, yeniyi ndi higa yangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Kangi akatola chikombi cha divayi, akamsengusa, akavapela akajova, “Mnywayi nyenye mwavoha, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />muni yeniyi ndi ngasi yangu yeyilangisa lilaganu, yeyiyitika ndava kuvalekekesa vandu vamahele kumbudila Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Nikuvajovela, ninywa lepi kavili divayi ya zabibu mbaka pa ligono peninywa ya mupya pamonga na nyenye mu Unkosi wa Dadi wangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Pavamali kuyimba lunyimbu lwa kumlumba Bambu, vakawuka na kuhamba kuchitumbi cha Mizeituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilota kuvya Petili yati akumbela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohani 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Kangi Yesu akavajovela, “Lelu kilu mwavoha nyenye yati mwitila na kunileka namwene, muni ndi chegijova Mayandiku Gamsopi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">‘Yati nikumkoma mdimaji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">na msambi woha wa mambelele yati wipechengana.’<verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Nambu panakayukayi, yati nikuvalongolela ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Penapo Petili akamyangula, “Hati ngati voha yati vakutila, nambu nene katu nikukuleka lepi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu akamyangula Petili, “Nikujovela chakaka, kilu yiyiyi kwakona lijogolo kuvika yati ukunibela mala yidatu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Petili akamjovela kavili, “Hati ngati yikunigana nifwayi pamonga na veve katu nikuleka lepi.” Na vala vawuliwa vangi vakajova mewawa.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuyupa Chapanga ku Gesemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maluko 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Kangi Yesu na vawuliwa vaki vakahamba pamonga pandu pepikemelewa Gesemane, ndi akavajovela, “Mtama apa na nene nihamba pala kumuyupa Chapanga.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Avatolili Petili na vana vavili va Zebedayo, Yesu akatumbula kuviniswa mtima na man'gaiso. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Kangi akavajovela, “Niviniswa neju mumtima hati papipi kufwa. Mtama bahapa mkoto kugona pamonga na nene.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Akahegelela palongolo, akagwa cha kukupama, akamuyupa Chapanga. “Dadi wangu, ngati yihotoleka chikombi ichi cha man'gaiso chiniyepa, nambu lepi chenigana nene, ndi ngati chaugana wamwene.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Kangi akavawuyila vawuliwa vala, avakolili vavi lugono. Akamkota Petili, “Wu, nakuhotola kutama changagona pamonga na nene hati saa yimonga ndu? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Mkoto kugona mumyupa Chapanga mkoto kugwa mukulingiwa. Mpungu wigana nambu higa yitamu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Yesu akahamba kavili, kumuyupa Chapanga, “Dadi wangu, ngati yihotoleka lepi chikombi cha man'gaiso aga chihamba changanywa nene, hinu mganu waku uhengekayi.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Peavawuyili kavili, na kuvakolela vagonili, ndava vavi na lugono neju.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Akavaleka, akahamba kangi mala ya datu kumuyupa Chapanga mu malovi galagala. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Kangi akavahambila vawuliwa vala akavajovela, “Wuli, mwakona mwigona na kupumulila? Mlolayi! Lukumbi lwene luhikili, na Mwana wa Mundu yati igotolewa kwa vandu vevambudila Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Muyima, tihamba. Mlolayi! Mweakunigotola yula avi papipi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ikamuliwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohani 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Lukumbi Yesu akona ilongela nawu, akabwela Yuda, mmonga pagati ya vawuliwa vaki kumi na vavili. Mwene pamonga na vandu vamahele vevagegili mapanga na vibonga vevatumwili na vakulu va kuteta na vagogo va vandu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Yuda mweakumng'anamukila Yesu amali kuvalangisa ulangisu “Yula mwenikumkumbatila ndi mumkamula.”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Hinu Yuda akamhegelela Yesu na kumjambusa, “Tukuwoni, Muwula,” Ndi akamkumbatila.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu akamyangula “Nkozi, kitayi cha ubweli kukita.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Penapo vandu vala vakamhegelela na vakamukamula Yesu, vakamvika muulonda wavi. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Mmonga wa vala vevavi pamonga na Yesu, akaholomola upanga waki akamtova nawu mtumisi wa Mteta mkulu akamdumula likutu. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Penapo Yesu akamjovela, “Wuyisa upanga waku pachihaku paki, ndava yeyoha mweikoma na upanga yati ifwa na upanga. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Wu, mwihololela lepi nihotola kumuyupa Dadi wangu, mwene ngaaniletili hinu misambi neju ya kumi na yivili va manjolinjoli vamitumu vaki va kunani? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Nambu gitimila wuli Mayandiku Gamsopi gegijova kuvya cheyiganikiwa gavyai?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Lukumbi lulolo Yesu akaujovela msambi wa vandu vala vevabweli kumkamula, “Wu, mbweli na mapanga na vibonga kunikamula ngati nene mwenangayidakila malagizu? Magono goha navi mu Nyumba ya Chapanga niwula, nambu mwanikamwili lepi.<verse eid="MAT 26:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Nambu mambu genaga goha gahengiki muni malovi gegajoviki na vamlota va Chapanga mu Mayandiku Gamsopi gatimilayi.” Kangi vawuliwa voha vakamleka na kutila.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu palongolo ya libanji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maluko 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohani 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Vandu vala vevamkamwili Yesu vamhindikili kunyumba ya Kayafa Mteta Mkulu, pavakonganiki vawula va malagizu na vagogo va Vayawudi. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Nambu Petili amlandili Yesu cha kutali mbaka kuluvanja lwa Mteta Mkulu, akayingila mugati pamonga na valonda muni alola mambu gegihumila. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Hinu vamteta vakulu na vakulu va Luvanja voha vakalonda malovi gaudesi ndava ya Yesu muni vamkoma. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Nambu nakupata chindu chochoha pamonga na ago, vabweli vandu vamahele kujova udesi, pamwishu vabweli vandu vavili, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />ndi vakajova, “Mundu uyu ajovili, ‘Ihotola kudenya Nyumba ya Chapanga na kujenga kavili mu magono gadatu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Mteta Mkulu akayima akamkota Yesu “Wu, wiyangula lepi? Vandu ava vakukutakila kyani kukuvala veve?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Nambu Yesu agunili nuu. Mteta Mkulu, akamjovela, “Nikulapakisa kwa Chapanga mweavimumi, utijovelayi ngati veve ndi Kilisitu, Mwana wa Chapanga!”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu akayangula, “Wamwene umali kujova! Nambu nikuvajovela, kuhuma hinu yati mukumlola Mwana wa Mundu atamili muchiwoko cha kulyelela cha Bambu mweavi na makakala, ibwela panani ya mahundi ga kunani kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Penapo, ndi Mteta Mkulu akapapula nyula zaki, akajova, “Amuligili Chapanga! Tigani lepi mundu yungi wa kumtakila! Hinu niyuwini cheamligili Chapanga! <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Nyenye muhololela wuli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Vene vakamyangula, “Yikumgana akomiwa!”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Kangi vakamuhunyila mata kumihu, vakamtova na vangi vakampamanda <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />vakamkota, “Ulotelayi, veve Kilisitu Msangula! Ndi yani mweakutovili!”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili akumbela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maluko 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohani 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Petili atamili kuvala ya luvanja. Ndi mtumisi mmonga mdala amhambili, akamjovela, “Veve wavi pamonga na Yesu wa ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Nambu Petili akabela palongolo ya voha, “Nichimanyi lepi chewijova.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Petili pahaumayi pamlyangu, mtumisi yungi msikana amuwene, ndi akavajovela vandu vevavi pala. Mundu uyu avi pamonga na Yesu wa ku Nazaleti.<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Petili akabela kavili kwa chilapu, “Nimmanyili lepi mundu uyu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Mwanakandahi, vandu vevayimili penapo vamhambili Petili, vakamjovela “Chakaka veve mmonga wavi, hati chaujova kukumanyisa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Kangi Petili akatumbula kujilapakisa likoto na kulapa ijova, “Nimmanyili lepi mundu uyu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Bahapo lijogolo likavika. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Petili akumbwiki malovi ga Yesu, geamjovili, “Kwakona lijogolo kuvika, yati ukunibela mala yidatu.” Ndi akahuma kuvala akavembeneka neju.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yesu vakumpeleka kwa Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maluko 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohani 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Lukela pehe, vakulu voha va kuteta, pamonga na vagogo va Chiyawudi vakajovesana ndava ya kumkoma Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Hinu vakamukunga, vakamutola na kumgotola kwa Pilatu mweavimkulu wa Loma.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufwa kwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Matendu 1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Kangi Yuda, mweamng'anamwikili Yesu paavawene kuvya vamali kumuhamula Yesu, akang'ahika neju mumtima waki, avawuyisili vakulu va kuteta mashonga gala hipandi selasini. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Akavajovela, “Nibudili kumng'anamukila mundu angabuda akomiwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Nambu vene, vakayangula, “Lenilo ndi lihengu laku? Umanya wamwene.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Mwene akataga hipandi ya mashonga gala Munyumba ya Chapanga, akahuma kuvala ya Nyumba ya Chapanga na kuhamba kujikungila.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Vakulu va kuteta vakatola mashonga genago, vakajova, “Mumbele ya malagizu gitu kuvika muchibana cha Nyumba ya Chapanga ndava muni mashonga gegapatikini kwa kukoma.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Hinu vakajovesana, vakatola mashonga gala kugula mgunda wa ludaka muni pavyaa pandu pa kuzikila vayehe. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ndava ya genago, hati lelu mgunda wenuwo wikemelewa “Mgunda ngasi mana yaki mgunda weuguliwi kwa ukomaji.”<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Ndi chagatimalili malovi ga Yelemia mweavi mlota wa Chapanga, “Valotili mashonga hipandi selasini, mashonga ya mwenuyo luhuna lwa vandu va Isilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />Vakahengela kugula mgunda wa madakali, ngati chealagazili Bambu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilatu akumkota Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maluko 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohani 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yesu akayima palongolo ya mkulu wa Loma, ndi mkulu yula akamkota, “Veve, ndi wa Nkosi wa Vayawudi?” Yesu akayangula, “Genago ndi ujovili wamwene.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Nambu vakulu va kuteta na vagogo pevamtakili, mwene ayangwili lepi linenu.<verse eid="MAT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Kangi Pilatu akamkota “Wu, wiyuwana lepi matakilu gevakukutakila veve?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Nambu Yesu ayangwili lepi hati linenu limonga, mkulu wa Loma akakangasa neju.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vakumuhamula kufwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maluko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohani 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Hinu yavi mvelu wa mkulu wa Loma lukumbi lwa mselebuko wa Pasaka, kuvadindulila Vayawudi mkungiwa mmonga mwevakumgana. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Lukumbi lwenulo peavili na mkungiwa mmonga mweamanyikini neju, mweikemiwa Balaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Ndi, vandu pavakonganiki pamonga, Pilatu akavakota, “Mwigana nivadindulilayi yani pagati ya vavili ava, Balaba amala Yesu mweikemiwa Kilisitu?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Ndava muni amanyili kuvya vachilongosi va chiyawudi vamuwusili Yesu ndava ya wihu.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Pilatu peatamili pachigoda chaki cha uhamula, mdala waki ampelikili ujumbi, “Ukoto kumhengela chindu chochoa mundu uyu angahoka ndava lelu nin'gaiki neju munjozi ndava ya mwenuyo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Nambu vakulu va kuteta na vagogo vakuvakulukisa vandu vamyupa Balaba adinduliwa na Yesu akomiwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Pilatu akavakota, “Ndi yani pagati ava vavili mwemukumgana nivadindulilayi nyenye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Vakamyangula mdindulayi, “Balaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilatu akavakota kavili, “Hinu nikita kyani na Yesu nweikemiwa Kilisitu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Voha vakayangula, “Avambiwa pamsalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Nambu Pilatu akavakota, “Ndava kyani? Abudili kiki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Ndi vene vakajova kwa lwami luvaha, “Avambiwa pamsalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Hinu, Pilatu paamanyili ngati yihotoleka lepi kuvagunisa, chitutu chitumbula, akatola manji, akasamba mawoko palongolo ya msambi wa vandu, akajova, “Yikunivala lepi ngasi ya mundu uyu, kwali mwavene.”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Vandu voha vakayangula, “Ngasi yaki yeyitika yivya ndava ya tete na vana vitu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Kangi Pilatu akamdindulila Balaba kuhuma muchifungu, na kumtova michapilu akamgotola Yesu avambiwa pamsalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manjolinjoli vakumvevesa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maluko 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohani 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Kangi manjolinjoli ga mkulu wa Loma, vamyingisi Yesu mugati ya nyumba ya nkosi, ndi manjolinjoli vakakonganeka msambi woha. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Vakamuwula nyula zaki, vakamuwalika nyula yidung'u ya chinkosi. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Kangi vakabota njingwa ya minga, vamuwaliki kumutu, vakamvikila mlayi muchiwoko chaki cha kulyela. Vakafugama palongolo yaki ndi vamvevisi vakumjovela, “Tukuwoni Nkosi wa Vayawudi!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Vakamuhunyila mata, vakatola mlayi wula, vakamtova nawu kumutu. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Pavamali kumvevesa, vakamuwula ligwanda lenilo, vamuwaliki nyula zaki, kangi vakamhindikila pa kumvamba pamsalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ivambiwa pamsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohani 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Pavavi mukuhamba vamkolili mundu mmonga liina laki Simoni mkolonjinji wa Kulene, kwa makakala vamgegisi msalaba wa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Pavahikili pandu pepikemelewa Goligota, mana yaki “Libangu la Mutu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Vakampela divayi yeyihangisini na nyongo. Nambu Yesu peamiyangili akabela kunywa.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Pavamali kumvamba pamsalaba, ndi vakatovela gudugudu kugavana nyula zaki. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Manjolinjoli vakatama penapo kumulindalila. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Panani ya mutu waki pamsalaba, vakayandika matakilu ga kumvala mwene “Mwenuyu ndi Yesu, Nkosi va Vayawudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Mewawa kwavi na vanyagaji vavili vavambiwi mu misalaba pamonga na Yesu, mmonga upandi waki wa kulyela na yungi upandi wa kumangeya.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Vandu vevapitayi njila yeniyo vamligili kuni vinyugusa mitu yavi na kujova, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />“Veve lepi! Mwewajova wihotola kudenya Nyumba ya Chapanga na kujenga kavili pamagono gadatu? Hinu ujisangula wamwene. Ngati veve wa Mwana wa Chapanga, ndi huluka pamsalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Mewawa vakulu va kuteta pamonga na vawula va malagizu na vagogo vamvevisi, na kujova, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Avasangwili vayaki, ihotola lepi kujisangula mwene! Ati mwene ndi Nkosi wa vandu va Isilaeli! Hinu ahulukayi pamsalaba na tete yati tikumsadika mwene. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Amhuvalili Chapanga na kujova mwene ndi Mwana wa Chapanga! Ngati Chapanga akumgana ihotola kumsangula!”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Mewawa vala vanyagaji veavambiwi nawu pamsalaba pamonga vamligili.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ifwa pamsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohani 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Kuhumila muhi wa saa sita mbaka saa tisa, chitita chatindili mulima woha. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Hinu payahikili saa tisa, Yesu akavemba neju, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Mana yaki, “Chapanga wangu, Chapanga wangu, ndava kyani unilekili?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Nambu vandu vangi vevayimili pala pevayuwini genago vakajova, “Akumkemela Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Mmonga wavi akajumba akatola lidodoki, akajwiga mudivayi yivavanu akaivika mumlayi akampela anywai.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Nambu vangi vakajova, “Leka tiloli ngati Eliya ibwela kumsangula.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Ndi Yesu akavembeneka kwa lwami luvaha, akafwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Penapo lipazia la Nyumba ya Chapanga lapapwiki hipandi hivili kuhumila kunani mbaka pahi, mulima woha wandendimi, na matalahu gakabayuka, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />matinda gagubwiki na vandu va Chapanga vamahele vevafwili vayukili. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Pevahumili mumatinda gavi, Yesu peamali kuyuka pamonga nawu, vakayingila Pamuji wa Msopi ndi Yelusalemu vawonikini na vandu vamahele.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Hinu, mkulu yula pamonga na manjolinjoli vevamyangalila Yesu, pavauwene mulima windendema na goha gegahumalili, vakayogopa neju, vakajova, “Chakaka mundu mwenuyu avi Mwana wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Pandu penapo kwavi na vadala vamahele vevatamili vilolokesa cha kutali, venavo ndi vevamlandili Yesu kuhuma ku Galilaya vakumhengela. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Pagati yavi avili Maliya kuhuma Magidala na Maliya nyina wavi Yakobo na Yosefu, pamonga na nyina wavi vana va Zebedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vakumzika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maluko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohani 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Palatipimi lilanga, abwelili mundu mmonga mkolo vindu vyamahele mkolonjinji wa Alimatei, liina laki Yosefu. Mwenuyu mewa avi muwuliwa wa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Amhambili Pilatu, akamuyupa higa ya Yesu. Pilatu akahamula vampelayi. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yosefu akayitola higa yila na kuutindisila nyula ya msopi, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />akauvika mulitinda laki la mupya leahongwili mulitalau, akalibilingisa liganga livaha kudinda mlyangu wa litinda akawuka. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Maliya mkolonjinji wa Magidala na Maliya yungi yula vatamili kulolokesa litinda.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulindalila litinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Chilau yaki, ndi Ligono la Kupumulila, ndi vakulu vakuteta na Vafalisayu vamhambili Pilatu. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Vakajova “Mkulu, tikumbwiki kuvya yula mchenjela ajovili peavili mumi kuvya akafwayi yati iyuka pagimalika magono gadatu, <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Hinu lagiza valonda valindalila litinda mbaka pegimalika magono gadatu ndava vawuliwa vaki vihotola kumuyiva na kuvajovela vandu kuvya ayukili. Muni udesi wa pamwishu wenuwu yati wivya uvaha neju kuliku wa kutumbula.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilatu akavayangula, “Muvi na manjolinjoli, muhamba mukalindila chemwihotola.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Hinu vakahamba kulindila litinda vakavika vidindilu liganga lila, vakaleka manjolinjoli bahapo vakulilindila.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Yesu iyuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maluko 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohani 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Ligono la Kupumulila palamaliki, lukela hamba kucha ligono la Dominika, Maliya mkolonjinji wa Magidala na muyaki Maliya yungi yula vahambili kulola litinda lila. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Bahapo mulima woha wandendimi neju, mtumu wa kunani kwa Bambu ahelili kuhumila kunani kwa Chapanga, alibilingisi liganga la pamlyangu na kutamila. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Awonikini ngati lumwetumwetu lwa mbamba na nyula zaki zavi za msopi pehe. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Valonda vevalindalila litinda vala vakavagaya neju ndava ya wogohi vavi ngati vamali kufwa.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Nambu mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akavajovela vadala vala, “Nyenye mkoto kuyogopa! Muni nimannyili kuvya mukumulonda Yesu mweavambiwi pamsalaba. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Avi lepi apa muni amali kuyuka ngati cheajovili. Mbwela mlola pandu pevamgonisi. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Hinu mhamba kanyata mkavajovela vawuliwa vaki kuvya amali kuyuka, na hinu akuvalongololela ku Galilaya yati mumkolela kwenuko. Yuwanila, nene nimali kuvajovela.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Hinu vadala vala kuni viyogopa na kuni viheka neju, vakawuka kanyata palitinda na kujumba kuhamba kuvajovela vawuliwa vaki.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Bahapo Yesu akakonganeka nawu, akavajambusa, “Nivawoni.” Vadala vala vakamhegelela na vakamkamula magendelu gaki na kumgundamila. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Kangi Yesu akavajovela, “Mkoto kuyogopa,” “Mhamba mkavajovela valongo vangu vahamba ku Galilaya kwenuko ndi yati vakunilola.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Madandaula ga valindila litinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Pevawukili vadala vala, ndi pagati ya valonda va litinda, vakahamba kumuji kuvadandaulila vateta vakulu mambu goha gevagawene. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Hinu vakakonganeka pamonga na vagogo, na kuvika mpangu, vakavapela mashonga gamahele manjolinjoli vala, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />vakajova, nyenye mjova kuvya, “Vawuliwa vaki vabweli kilu, vakamuyiva tete petatitili lugono. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Ngati mkulu wa Loma akayuwana lijambu lenili tete yati tikuvatangatila tikumkulukisa, muni nyenye mkoto kuvya na mhalu.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Hinu manjolinjoli vala vakatola mashonga gala, vakahenga ngati chavawuliwi, malovi ago gadandasiki kwa Vayawudi mbaka lelu.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvahumila vawuliwa vaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohani 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Matendu 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Kangi vawuliwa kumi na mmonga vala vakahamba kuchitumbi chechivii ku Galilaya cheavalagazili Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Pavamuwene, vakagundama, nambu vangi vavi na mtahu. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu avahegalili, akavajovela, “Nipewili uhotola woha kunani kwa Chapanga na pamulima. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Hinu mhamba mkavakita vandu va milima yoha kuvya vawuliwa vangu. Kuni mvabatiza kwa liina la Dadi na la Mwana na la Mpungu Msopi. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Muvawula kukamula malovi gangu goha ngati chenivalagizi nyenye, nene nivii pamonga na nyenye magono goha, hati pamwishu wa lusenje.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>